⠀an⠀ordinary⠀gesture.⠀Use⠀syntax⠀to⠀carry⠀that⠀experience.⠀A⠀sentence⠀may⠀gather⠀clauses⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀character⠀gathers⠀impressions,⠀then⠀turn⠀on⠀a⠀plainer⠀statement⠀that⠀names⠀what⠀the⠀gathered⠀detail⠀has⠀made⠀present.\n\nDevelop⠀comparisons⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀materials⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀associations.⠀A⠀metaphor⠀may⠀begin⠀as⠀an⠀observation⠀about⠀one⠀object⠀and⠀unfold⠀into⠀a⠀recognition⠀about⠀the⠀character's⠀situation,⠀but⠀the⠀connection⠀must⠀be⠀traceable:⠀the⠀image⠀should⠀not⠀arrive⠀as⠀decoration.⠀When⠀a⠀speculative⠀fact⠀matters,⠀let⠀the⠀character⠀encounter⠀it⠀through⠀perception⠀and⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀summary.⠀A⠀relevant⠀explanation⠀can⠀be⠀given⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀terms,⠀shaped⠀by⠀what⠀they⠀notice,⠀fear,⠀want,⠀or⠀remember.⠀Plain⠀sentences⠀provide⠀contrast⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀lyricism⠀from⠀becoming⠀uniform.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access⠀consistent.⠀Other⠀characters'⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀outside⠀it,⠀though⠀their⠀visible⠀behavior⠀may⠀be⠀rendered⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀sensory⠀attention.⠀Dialogue⠀need⠀not⠀adopt⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register;⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀flatly⠀or⠀practically⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀continues⠀its⠀own⠀rhythm.⠀The⠀speculative⠀world⠀remains⠀consequential,⠀not⠀merely⠀picturesque.⠀An⠀image⠀should⠀reveal⠀how⠀the⠀change⠀has⠀entered⠀a⠀practice,⠀a⠀relationship,⠀or⠀a⠀possible⠀future.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀pause⠀where⠀the⠀present⠀attention⠀settles,⠀whether⠀that⠀is⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀perception⠀still⠀forming.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanauap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀be⠀measured⠀by⠀what⠀it⠀has⠀made⠀different⠀over⠀time.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀how⠀a⠀familiar⠀procedure⠀has⠀altered,⠀how⠀a⠀place⠀no⠀longer⠀sounds⠀or⠀smells⠀as⠀it⠀once⠀did,⠀or⠀how⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀mean⠀one⠀thing⠀now⠀carries⠀another⠀weight.⠀Use⠀remembered⠀occasions⠀as⠀evidence,⠀not⠀as⠀ornaments.⠀A⠀memory⠀should⠀enter⠀because⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀calls⠀it⠀forward:⠀the⠀same⠀object,⠀gesture,⠀routine,⠀or⠀absence⠀makes⠀the⠀comparison⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀narrator.\n\nAllow⠀present⠀experience⠀and⠀recollection⠀to⠀coexist.⠀The⠀character⠀can⠀enjoy⠀an⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀while⠀also⠀knowing⠀it⠀has⠀become⠀rarer⠀or⠀differently⠀conditioned.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀scene⠀to⠀end⠀by⠀announcing⠀loss.⠀The⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀may⠀be⠀an⠀unfinished⠀attachment,⠀a⠀postponed⠀return,⠀a⠀body⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀responds⠀as⠀it⠀once⠀did,⠀or⠀a⠀future⠀that⠀has⠀narrowed⠀without⠀becoming⠀wholly⠀closed.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀reflect⠀directly⠀when⠀the⠀perspective⠀permits,⠀or⠀let⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀association⠀without⠀explanation.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀world's⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀and⠀practical⠀life⠀present⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀reflection⠀is⠀grounded.⠀A⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀should⠀illuminate⠀how⠀the⠀change⠀entered⠀daily⠀practice,⠀not⠀float⠀free⠀of⠀it.⠀Other⠀characters⠀may⠀remember⠀differently⠀or⠀not⠀at⠀all;⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access⠀to⠀their⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀limited.⠀Dialogue⠀can⠀be⠀ordinary⠀and⠀practical⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀holds⠀the⠀reflective⠀register.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀pause⠀with⠀the⠀reflection⠀still⠀open,⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀still⠀unfinished,⠀or⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀continuing⠀under⠀the⠀changed⠀conditions.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanauaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀framed,⠀orally⠀situated⠀telling⠀as⠀the⠀route⠀for⠀speculative⠀fiction.⠀Establish⠀who⠀is⠀speaking,⠀to⠀whom,⠀and⠀on⠀what⠀occasion,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀frame⠀remains⠀brief.⠀The⠀teller's⠀position⠀shapes⠀the⠀account:⠀what⠀they⠀witnessed,⠀what⠀they⠀were⠀told,⠀what⠀they⠀choose⠀to⠀emphasize,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀defer⠀or⠀leave⠀for⠀a⠀later⠀moment.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀should⠀enter⠀through⠀the⠀teller's⠀concrete⠀knowledge⠀and⠀the⠀audience's⠀need⠀to⠀understand⠀it.⠀An⠀explanation⠀can⠀be⠀offered⠀because⠀a⠀listener⠀asks,⠀because⠀a⠀practice⠀must⠀be⠀made⠀intelligible,⠀or⠀because⠀the⠀teller⠀anticipates⠀a⠀misunderstanding.\n\nLet⠀the⠀telling⠀move⠀between⠀the⠀frame⠀and⠀the⠀told⠀events.⠀A⠀listener's⠀question⠀or⠀reaction⠀may⠀interrupt⠀the⠀account⠀and⠀change⠀its⠀direction.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀repeat⠀a⠀phrase⠀or⠀image⠀when⠀it⠀gathers⠀new⠀meaning,⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail⠀to⠀show⠀its⠀later⠀consequence.⠀Keep⠀the⠀told⠀events⠀vivid⠀and⠀particular:⠀the⠀speculative⠀world⠀should⠀be⠀encountered⠀through⠀work,⠀bodies,⠀institutions,⠀communication,⠀and⠀daily⠀practice,⠀not⠀through⠀abstract⠀exposition.⠀The⠀frame's⠀present⠀may⠀be⠀as⠀consequential⠀as⠀the⠀events⠀being⠀recounted.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀teller's⠀limited⠀access.⠀They⠀cannot⠀report⠀another⠀character's⠀private⠀thought⠀unless⠀the⠀account⠀establishes⠀how⠀they⠀came⠀to⠀know⠀it.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀saw⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀inferred⠀or⠀were⠀told.⠀The⠀tradition⠀supplies⠀a⠀situated⠀oral⠀form,⠀not⠀a⠀requirement⠀of⠀antiquity,⠀mysticism,⠀exile,⠀religion,⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀honor⠀code.⠀The⠀setting,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀remain⠀those⠀actually⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀pause⠀with⠀the⠀frame⠀still⠀open:⠀a⠀listener's⠀question⠀unanswered,⠀the⠀teller⠀hesitating,⠀or⠀the⠀occasion⠀continuing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanauar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀speculative⠀change.⠀One⠀altered⠀object,⠀gesture,⠀surface,⠀or⠀procedure⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀world's⠀difference⠀present⠀without⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀exposition.⠀Choose⠀details⠀that⠀have⠀a⠀practical⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀aim⠀or⠀situation:⠀the⠀thing⠀they⠀must⠀handle,⠀the⠀step⠀they⠀no⠀longer⠀perform,⠀the⠀sign⠀they⠀read⠀twice.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀sequence⠀of⠀actions⠀or⠀observations⠀do⠀the⠀explanatory⠀work.\n\nKeep⠀only⠀the⠀inward⠀connection⠀that⠀materially⠀contributes.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀one⠀sentence⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀detail⠀means,⠀or⠀none⠀at⠀all⠀if⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀context⠀make⠀it⠀inferable.⠀When⠀an⠀explanation⠀is⠀needed⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀or⠀experience⠀to⠀be⠀intelligible,⠀give⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀terms⠀and⠀stop⠀when⠀it⠀has⠀served⠀that⠀purpose.⠀Do⠀not⠀delete⠀causality:⠀if⠀a⠀consequence⠀matters,⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀infer⠀why⠀it⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀narration⠀does⠀not⠀spell⠀it⠀out.\n\nLet⠀omission⠀leave⠀something⠀inferable.⠀A⠀skipped⠀step⠀or⠀unspoken⠀feeling⠀can⠀be⠀present⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀next⠀action,⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀attend⠀to.⠀Dialogue⠀remains⠀individual⠀and⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀stripped⠀to⠀the⠀narrator's⠀register.⠀Shortness⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀quota;⠀a⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀may⠀serve⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀performed⠀fragments.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀pause⠀after⠀a⠀single⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀decision,⠀or⠀a⠀perception⠀whose⠀implication⠀is⠀clear⠀without⠀being⠀announced.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanauas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀speculative⠀world⠀in⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose.⠀Open⠀inside⠀a⠀particular⠀situation:⠀a⠀task,⠀conversation,⠀journey,⠀or⠀decision⠀that⠀already⠀carries⠀the⠀premise's⠀consequences.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀encounter⠀the⠀altered⠀world⠀through⠀their⠀own⠀aims⠀and⠀knowledge.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀as⠀the⠀scene⠀requires.⠀A⠀speculative⠀fact⠀can⠀surface⠀because⠀a⠀character⠀must⠀act⠀on⠀it,⠀explain⠀it,⠀notice⠀its⠀effect,⠀or⠀remember⠀how⠀it⠀used⠀to⠀be⠀handled.\n\nUse⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.⠀A⠀new⠀paragraph⠀may⠀mark⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀attention,⠀speaker,⠀place,⠀or⠀time,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀restate⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀already⠀established.⠀When⠀an⠀explanation⠀is⠀needed,⠀give⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀terms⠀and⠀tie⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀decision⠀or⠀experience.⠀Do⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀a⠀technical⠀lecture.⠀The⠀contemporary-novel⠀presentation⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀contemporary⠀setting,⠀understated⠀emotion,⠀realism⠀as⠀world⠀physics,⠀or⠀a⠀lesson⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀every⠀reply.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice,⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene,⠀and⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀set⠀the⠀register⠀and⠀rhythm.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀be⠀plain⠀or⠀figurative⠀as⠀the⠀moment⠀warrants,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀remain⠀continuous⠀and⠀unobtrusive.⠀Other⠀characters'⠀private⠀experience⠀stays⠀outside⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀it.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀pause⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀resting⠀point:⠀a⠀conversation⠀concluded,⠀a⠀task⠀advanced,⠀a⠀decision⠀made,⠀or⠀a⠀situation⠀still⠀developing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanauat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀enter⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀scene⠀selection.⠀Choose⠀moments⠀where⠀the⠀altered⠀world⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀do⠀for⠀each⠀other,⠀how⠀they⠀communicate,⠀what⠀they⠀fear,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀promise.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀be⠀built⠀around⠀a⠀small⠀domestic⠀act⠀that⠀the⠀premise⠀has⠀made⠀newly⠀significant,⠀a⠀conversation⠀that⠀could⠀not⠀have⠀happened⠀before,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀problem⠀that⠀reveals⠀how⠀the⠀characters⠀understand⠀each⠀other.⠀The⠀relationship⠀premise⠀and⠀the⠀science⠀fiction⠀premise⠀should⠀explain⠀each⠀other:⠀the⠀world's⠀consequence⠀is⠀felt⠀in⠀the⠀relationship,⠀and⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀promise⠀shapes⠀how⠀the⠀characters⠀meet⠀that⠀consequence.\n\nUse⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments⠀as⠀the⠀relationship's⠀evidence.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀shared⠀reference⠀can⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀new⠀weight.⠀Give⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀enough⠀space⠀where⠀it⠀belongs,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀insert⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise.⠀The⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀should⠀fulfill⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀promise,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀expectation⠀of⠀confession⠀or⠀reconciliation.⠀Characters⠀may⠀misunderstand⠀each⠀other,⠀withhold,⠀or⠀act⠀on⠀imperfect⠀knowledge;⠀their⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀their⠀own⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀grants⠀access.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀speculative⠀world⠀consequential⠀beyond⠀the⠀relationship.⠀Institutions,⠀work,⠀bodies,⠀and⠀possible⠀futures⠀remain⠀real⠀pressures⠀on⠀the⠀characters.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀pause⠀with⠀the⠀relationship's⠀situation⠀still⠀developing:⠀a⠀comfort⠀offered,⠀a⠀discovery⠀made,⠀a⠀rivalry⠀sharpened,⠀or⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀between⠀them.⠀The⠀scene's⠀emotional⠀weight⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀characters⠀and⠀the⠀specific⠀premise,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀imposed⠀beat⠀of⠀crisis⠀or⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanauau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀deeds⠀and⠀their⠀remembered⠀consequences.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀statement⠀that⠀establishes⠀who⠀acted,⠀what⠀was⠀at⠀stake,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀telling⠀will⠀make⠀known.⠀Use⠀compact⠀declarations⠀to⠀fix⠀a⠀person,⠀place,⠀or⠀act,⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀declaration⠀incomplete.⠀The⠀altered⠀world⠀should⠀be⠀encountered⠀through⠀what⠀people⠀did:⠀the⠀work⠀they⠀undertook,⠀the⠀institutions⠀they⠀served⠀or⠀defied,⠀the⠀journeys⠀they⠀made,⠀the⠀promises⠀they⠀kept⠀or⠀broke.⠀A⠀speculative⠀fact⠀can⠀enter⠀the⠀account⠀because⠀it⠀shaped⠀a⠀deed⠀or⠀its⠀aftermath.\n\nUse⠀recurring⠀phrasing⠀with⠀purpose.⠀A⠀designation,⠀formula,⠀or⠀image⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀new⠀application.⠀The⠀relation⠀of⠀an⠀act⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀is⠀central:⠀the⠀telling⠀may⠀note⠀that⠀a⠀decision⠀seemed⠀small⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀particular⠀consequence⠀was⠀not⠀understood⠀until⠀later.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀can⠀report⠀what⠀was⠀seen,⠀said,⠀or⠀later⠀learned,⠀but⠀it⠀cannot⠀enter⠀another⠀character's⠀private⠀thought⠀without⠀an⠀established⠀source.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀teller's⠀judgment⠀from⠀the⠀recorded⠀facts.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀permits.⠀A⠀participant⠀may⠀correct⠀a⠀detail,⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀concern,⠀or⠀remember⠀the⠀event⠀differently.⠀This⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀parody.⠀The⠀saga⠀presentation⠀supplies⠀an⠀oral-chronicle⠀form,⠀not⠀a⠀Nordic⠀pantheon,⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀dialogue⠀for⠀every⠀speaker.⠀The⠀setting⠀and⠀community⠀remain⠀those⠀actually⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀pause⠀with⠀the⠀account⠀still⠀open,⠀a⠀deed⠀still⠀in⠀motion,⠀or⠀the⠀teller⠀marking⠀what⠀remains⠀to⠀be⠀told.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanauav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀social-institutional⠀realism⠀route:⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀has⠀already⠀entered⠀public⠀administration⠀and⠀domestic⠀obligation,⠀and⠀the⠀telling⠀follows⠀one⠀person's⠀practical⠀negotiation⠀with⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀treat⠀the⠀change⠀as⠀a⠀single⠀discovery.⠀It⠀appears⠀through⠀forms,⠀queues,⠀meetings,⠀follow-up⠀letters,⠀workplace⠀routines,⠀housing⠀rules,⠀or⠀family⠀duties⠀that⠀now⠀depend⠀on⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀close⠀to⠀that⠀person's⠀aims⠀and⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀worker,⠀parent,⠀neighbor,⠀official,⠀or⠀someone⠀with⠀an⠀unfinished⠀private⠀concern,⠀but⠀the⠀method⠀is⠀not⠀to⠀list⠀possible⠀roles;⠀it⠀is⠀to⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀speculative⠀fact⠀alters⠀an⠀existing⠀responsibility.⠀A⠀new⠀regulation,⠀altered⠀body,⠀changed⠀communication⠀practice,⠀or⠀uncertain⠀future⠀becomes⠀meaningful⠀when⠀it⠀touches⠀a⠀decision⠀the⠀character⠀must⠀actually⠀make⠀now.\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀become⠀legible⠀through⠀administrative⠀friction.⠀Show⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀an⠀institution⠀promises⠀and⠀what⠀its⠀forms,⠀waiting⠀periods,⠀reassignments,⠀and⠀follow-up⠀letters⠀actually⠀permit.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀be⠀asked⠀to⠀prove⠀something⠀they⠀cannot⠀document,⠀wait⠀for⠀an⠀answer⠀that⠀affects⠀someone⠀else,⠀or⠀discover⠀that⠀a⠀rule⠀was⠀written⠀for⠀a⠀condition⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀matches⠀their⠀situation.⠀These⠀are⠀consequences⠀of⠀the⠀premise,⠀not⠀arbitrary⠀obstacles.\n\nLet⠀characters⠀disagree⠀about⠀the⠀same⠀change⠀for⠀practical⠀reasons.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀fear⠀the⠀cost,⠀another⠀may⠀need⠀the⠀service,⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀distrust⠀the⠀authority⠀managing⠀it.⠀Their⠀positions⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀their⠀circumstances⠀and⠀history,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀fixed⠀temperament.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀equally⠀perceptive⠀or⠀equally⠀resigned.\n\nGive⠀explanations⠀only⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀needs⠀to⠀understand⠀something⠀in⠀order⠀to⠀act.⠀A⠀short⠀explanation⠀during⠀a⠀workplace⠀conversation,⠀a⠀public⠀information⠀session,⠀or⠀a⠀family⠀argument⠀is⠀enough.⠀The⠀speculative⠀premise⠀may⠀remain⠀partly⠀opaque⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀living⠀with⠀it;⠀what⠀matters⠀is⠀how⠀they⠀respond⠀to⠀the⠀part⠀they⠀can⠀see.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀interiority⠀as⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience.⠀A⠀restrained⠀public⠀manner⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀an⠀empty⠀mind.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀show⠀the⠀character⠀weighing⠀a⠀request,⠀remembering⠀an⠀earlier⠀promise,⠀or⠀noticing⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀an⠀official⠀statement⠀and⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀report.⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀that⠀private⠀reasoning⠀unless⠀the⠀person⠀speaks⠀or⠀acts⠀on⠀it.\n\nEnd⠀a⠀scene⠀when⠀the⠀immediate⠀exchange⠀or⠀task⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point.⠀The⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀may⠀remain⠀unresolved.⠀A⠀meeting⠀can⠀end⠀without⠀a⠀decision,⠀a⠀form⠀can⠀be⠀submitted⠀without⠀an⠀answer,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀return⠀home⠀still⠀uncertain.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀revelation,⠀a⠀completed⠀investigation,⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀change⠀of⠀belief.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanauaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀as⠀a⠀visible⠀change⠀in⠀ordinary⠀routine.⠀Show⠀altered⠀equipment,⠀public⠀notices,⠀modified⠀workspaces,⠀or⠀the⠀physical⠀traces⠀of⠀a⠀new⠀institution,⠀and⠀let⠀characters⠀respond⠀to⠀those⠀visible⠀facts⠀through⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀aims.⠀A⠀scene⠀heading⠀marks⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀location⠀or⠀time;⠀keep⠀action⠀lines⠀concise⠀and⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀filmed⠀or⠀heard.\n\nGive⠀each⠀speaker⠀a⠀clear⠀cue⠀and⠀let⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀exchange.⠀Characters⠀may⠀discuss⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀because⠀it⠀affects⠀a⠀decision⠀they⠀are⠀making⠀now:⠀whether⠀to⠀report⠀a⠀malfunction,⠀accept⠀a⠀placement,⠀trust⠀a⠀service,⠀or⠀continue⠀a⠀task.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀dialogue⠀as⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀technical⠀exposition.⠀A⠀brief⠀spoken⠀explanation⠀is⠀enough⠀when⠀one⠀character⠀needs⠀to⠀inform⠀another.\n\nLet⠀the⠀premise⠀become⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀routine⠀is⠀supposed⠀to⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀now⠀requires.⠀A⠀worker⠀can⠀be⠀told⠀to⠀follow⠀a⠀procedure⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀matches⠀the⠀equipment⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀A⠀public⠀announcement⠀can⠀promise⠀a⠀service⠀while⠀the⠀visible⠀queue,⠀locked⠀door,⠀or⠀empty⠀desk⠀shows⠀otherwise.⠀These⠀contrasts⠀are⠀scene⠀facts,⠀not⠀narrator⠀commentary.\n\nUse⠀cuts,⠀offscreen⠀sound,⠀or⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀requires⠀them.⠀An⠀offscreen⠀alarm⠀can⠀establish⠀that⠀a⠀system⠀is⠀failing.⠀A⠀cut⠀can⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀public⠀announcement⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀consequence.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands⠀or⠀repeated⠀shot⠀descriptions.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀dialogue⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀The⠀note⠀may⠀record⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices,⠀fears,⠀remembers,⠀or⠀decides⠀without⠀speaking.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀that⠀private⠀material⠀into⠀a⠀voice-over⠀merely⠀to⠀make⠀it⠀audible.\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀affect⠀ordinary⠀institutions⠀and⠀relationships.⠀A⠀workplace⠀can⠀have⠀new⠀safety⠀rules,⠀a⠀household⠀can⠀depend⠀on⠀a⠀service⠀that⠀is⠀changing,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀office⠀can⠀issue⠀instructions⠀that⠀contradict⠀local⠀experience.⠀The⠀scene⠀should⠀show⠀people⠀negotiating⠀those⠀consequences⠀through⠀action⠀and⠀speech,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀narrator⠀explaining⠀the⠀world.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀scene⠀when⠀the⠀immediate⠀action⠀or⠀exchange⠀reaches⠀a⠀stopping⠀point.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀leave,⠀a⠀task⠀can⠀be⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀a⠀conversation⠀can⠀end⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀larger⠀speculative⠀question.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀reveal,⠀a⠀completed⠀plan,⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀explanation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanauax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀as⠀a⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀shared⠀stage⠀space.⠀Let⠀characters⠀encounter⠀it⠀through⠀objects⠀they⠀can⠀handle,⠀entrances⠀they⠀make,⠀procedures⠀they⠀follow,⠀or⠀work⠀they⠀perform⠀in⠀view⠀of⠀the⠀audience.⠀A⠀changed⠀device,⠀a⠀new⠀form,⠀an⠀altered⠀body,⠀or⠀an⠀institutional⠀rule⠀becomes⠀meaningful⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀in⠀the⠀scene.\n\nUse⠀clear⠀speaker⠀names⠀and⠀economical⠀stage⠀directions.⠀Mark⠀entrances⠀and⠀exits,⠀pauses,⠀blocking,⠀and⠀significant⠀objects.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀exchange.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀continue⠀a⠀task⠀while⠀speaking,⠀refuse⠀to⠀look⠀at⠀another⠀person,⠀or⠀place⠀an⠀object⠀between⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀film-camera⠀instructions.\n\nMake⠀the⠀premise⠀testable⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀stage⠀permits.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀claims⠀a⠀device⠀is⠀working,⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀see⠀whether⠀the⠀object⠀responds⠀when⠀handled.⠀If⠀someone⠀says⠀a⠀door⠀is⠀locked,⠀the⠀entrance⠀or⠀attempted⠀exit⠀can⠀confirm⠀or⠀complicate⠀that⠀claim.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀should⠀alter⠀the⠀physical⠀possibilities⠀of⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀merely⠀provide⠀a⠀topic⠀for⠀discussion.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀arise⠀from⠀practical⠀aims.⠀Characters⠀may⠀argue⠀about⠀whether⠀to⠀trust⠀a⠀service,⠀follow⠀a⠀new⠀rule,⠀report⠀a⠀malfunction,⠀or⠀accept⠀a⠀visitor.⠀They⠀do⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀in⠀full.⠀A⠀short⠀spoken⠀explanation⠀is⠀enough⠀when⠀one⠀character⠀needs⠀another⠀to⠀understand⠀a⠀relevant⠀fact.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀aside⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀heard⠀by⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀The⠀material⠀may⠀record⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀notices,⠀fears,⠀remembers,⠀or⠀decides⠀without⠀speaking.⠀Use⠀a⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀requires⠀it,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀thought.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀grounded⠀in⠀ordinary⠀institutions⠀and⠀relationships.⠀A⠀household⠀can⠀depend⠀on⠀a⠀service⠀that⠀is⠀changing,⠀a⠀workplace⠀can⠀enforce⠀new⠀rules,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀office⠀can⠀make⠀a⠀demand⠀that⠀conflicts⠀with⠀local⠀knowledge.⠀Show⠀people⠀negotiating⠀those⠀consequences⠀through⠀staged⠀action⠀and⠀speech.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀scene⠀when⠀the⠀immediate⠀exchange⠀or⠀task⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀leave,⠀a⠀task⠀can⠀be⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀a⠀conversation⠀can⠀end⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀larger⠀speculative⠀question.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀theatrical⠀revelation,⠀a⠀completed⠀investigation,⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀change⠀of⠀belief.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanauay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀through⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind's⠀associative⠀movement.⠀Let⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀carry⠀the⠀telling.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀should⠀surface⠀as⠀something⠀the⠀mind⠀keeps⠀returning⠀to:⠀a⠀remembered⠀instruction,⠀an⠀altered⠀body,⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀now⠀strange,⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀public⠀announcement,⠀or⠀a⠀worry⠀that⠀interrupts⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task.\n\nGive⠀the⠀recurring⠀concern⠀a⠀concrete⠀anchor.⠀The⠀same⠀object,⠀sound,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀bodily⠀feeling⠀should⠀reappear⠀when⠀the⠀mind⠀moves⠀between⠀present⠀scene,⠀memory,⠀and⠀anticipation.⠀That⠀anchor⠀keeps⠀the⠀association⠀legible⠀and⠀prevents⠀the⠀speculation⠀from⠀becoming⠀a⠀free-floating⠀mood.⠀When⠀the⠀mind⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀anchor,⠀show⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀to⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀events⠀from⠀recollection⠀or⠀fantasy.⠀When⠀the⠀mind⠀moves⠀from⠀a⠀present⠀scene⠀to⠀a⠀memory,⠀make⠀the⠀shift⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀anchor.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀associations⠀dissolve⠀the⠀scene⠀facts.⠀The⠀speculative⠀premise⠀remains⠀real⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀understands⠀it⠀only⠀partially.\n\nLet⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀aims⠀and⠀knowledge⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀mind⠀selects.⠀A⠀worker⠀may⠀keep⠀returning⠀to⠀a⠀malfunctioning⠀system,⠀a⠀parent⠀to⠀a⠀child's⠀changed⠀body,⠀a⠀patient⠀to⠀a⠀clinic's⠀instructions.⠀The⠀associations⠀are⠀not⠀random;⠀they⠀follow⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀needs,⠀fears,⠀or⠀cannot⠀yet⠀resolve.⠀Ordinary⠀reasoning⠀alone⠀is⠀not⠀enough.⠀The⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀should⠀follow⠀the⠀movement⠀of⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀linear⠀report.\n\nDo⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀share⠀a⠀mind.⠀The⠀stream⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀authorized⠀focal⠀consciousness.⠀Other⠀characters⠀remain⠀distinct⠀through⠀their⠀speech,⠀actions,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀mind's⠀interpretation⠀of⠀them.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀misunderstand⠀another⠀person;⠀that⠀misunderstanding⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀private⠀experience,⠀not⠀a⠀fact⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀mind.\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀affect⠀everyday⠀practice⠀and⠀institutions⠀through⠀the⠀mind's⠀attention⠀to⠀them.⠀A⠀new⠀procedure⠀can⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀remembered⠀form,⠀a⠀bodily⠀change⠀as⠀a⠀recurring⠀sensation,⠀a⠀communication⠀shift⠀as⠀a⠀phrase⠀the⠀character⠀repeats⠀without⠀deciding⠀what⠀it⠀means.⠀The⠀telling⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀consequence⠀felt⠀rather⠀than⠀explained⠀in⠀a⠀technical⠀passage.\n\nEnd⠀when⠀the⠀associative⠀movement⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause.⠀The⠀mind⠀can⠀settle⠀on⠀a⠀question,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀task,⠀or⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀an⠀actual⠀event.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀completed⠀realization,⠀a⠀resolved⠀decision,⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀clarity.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanauaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀through⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Let⠀the⠀change⠀appear⠀in⠀what⠀people⠀send,⠀delay,⠀edit,⠀attach,⠀or⠀leave⠀unsent.⠀A⠀new⠀institution⠀may⠀send⠀automated⠀notices,⠀a⠀workplace⠀may⠀require⠀check-ins,⠀a⠀family⠀may⠀coordinate⠀around⠀a⠀changed⠀body⠀or⠀service,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀may⠀try⠀to⠀explain⠀a⠀malfunction⠀in⠀a⠀few⠀lines.⠀Each⠀sender's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀should⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution.\n\nMake⠀the⠀premise⠀legible⠀through⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀exchange⠀can⠀carry.⠀A⠀new⠀reporting⠀channel⠀may⠀require⠀a⠀format⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀fit⠀the⠀sender's⠀situation.⠀An⠀automated⠀notice⠀may⠀demand⠀a⠀response⠀the⠀recipient⠀cannot⠀give.⠀A⠀familiar⠀contact⠀may⠀suddenly⠀write⠀through⠀a⠀monitored⠀service,⠀changing⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀willing⠀to⠀say.⠀These⠀shifts⠀are⠀consequences⠀of⠀the⠀speculative⠀change,⠀not⠀interface⠀decoration.\n\nUse⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter.⠀A⠀long⠀delay⠀can⠀show⠀hesitation⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀interruption.⠀An⠀edit⠀can⠀show⠀a⠀correction⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀mind.⠀A⠀read⠀receipt⠀can⠀matter⠀when⠀someone⠀chooses⠀not⠀to⠀reply.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀interface⠀events⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.\n\nDistinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀Required⠀private⠀experience⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀clearly⠀separated⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀transmitted⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀known⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀participants.\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀affect⠀everyday⠀practice⠀and⠀institutions⠀through⠀the⠀exchange.⠀A⠀public⠀service⠀can⠀change⠀its⠀messaging⠀rules,⠀a⠀workplace⠀can⠀introduce⠀a⠀new⠀reporting⠀channel,⠀or⠀a⠀household⠀can⠀depend⠀on⠀a⠀system⠀that⠀is⠀failing.⠀Characters⠀encounter⠀these⠀consequences⠀through⠀their⠀own⠀aims:⠀asking⠀for⠀help,⠀confirming⠀a⠀time,⠀disputing⠀a⠀charge,⠀or⠀checking⠀on⠀someone.\n\nKeep⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀brief⠀and⠀clearly⠀separated⠀when⠀required.⠀It⠀may⠀establish⠀where⠀a⠀character⠀is,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀notice⠀before⠀sending⠀a⠀message.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀surrounding⠀context⠀replace⠀the⠀transcript⠀as⠀the⠀primary⠀carrier⠀of⠀the⠀story.\n\nEnd⠀when⠀the⠀exchange⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point.⠀A⠀question⠀can⠀remain⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀conversation⠀can⠀trail⠀off,⠀or⠀a⠀sender⠀can⠀stop⠀replying.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀resolution,⠀a⠀completed⠀explanation,⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀message.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanauba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀scene⠀that⠀could⠀be⠀illustrated.⠀Use⠀concise⠀scene-setting⠀to⠀establish⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀and⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀in⠀that⠀place:⠀a⠀new⠀device,⠀an⠀altered⠀public⠀notice,⠀a⠀modified⠀workspace,⠀or⠀the⠀visible⠀trace⠀of⠀an⠀institution.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀fact⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀environment⠀and⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀do⠀there.\n\nGive⠀the⠀changed⠀environment⠀a⠀specific⠀focal⠀detail.⠀The⠀scene-setting⠀should⠀name⠀one⠀altered⠀object,⠀surface,⠀or⠀arrangement⠀that⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀return⠀to⠀that⠀detail⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀reacts⠀privately⠀or⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀line⠀changes⠀its⠀meaning.⠀Do⠀not⠀scatter⠀speculative⠀props⠀without⠀a⠀focal⠀relation.\n\nGive⠀each⠀speaker⠀clear⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Let⠀conversation⠀arise⠀from⠀practical⠀aims:⠀asking⠀for⠀help,⠀disputing⠀a⠀rule,⠀confirming⠀a⠀procedure,⠀or⠀checking⠀on⠀someone.⠀A⠀short⠀spoken⠀explanation⠀is⠀enough⠀when⠀one⠀character⠀needs⠀another⠀to⠀understand⠀a⠀relevant⠀fact.⠀Do⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀technical⠀exposition.\n\nUse⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀a⠀detail,⠀react⠀to⠀a⠀statement,⠀or⠀remember⠀an⠀earlier⠀event.⠀Keep⠀that⠀private⠀experience⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀know.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀expression⠀into⠀a⠀truth⠀indicator;⠀a⠀changed⠀expression⠀can⠀draw⠀attention,⠀but⠀the⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀must⠀be⠀established⠀through⠀scene⠀facts⠀and⠀actions.\n\nUse⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀as⠀purposeful⠀references,⠀not⠀executable⠀engine⠀code⠀or⠀mandatory⠀labels.⠀A⠀background⠀cue⠀may⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀a⠀changed⠀environment.⠀An⠀expression⠀cue⠀may⠀mark⠀a⠀reaction.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀affect⠀everyday⠀practice⠀and⠀institutions.⠀A⠀workplace⠀can⠀have⠀new⠀rules,⠀a⠀household⠀can⠀depend⠀on⠀a⠀service⠀that⠀is⠀changing,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀office⠀can⠀issue⠀instructions⠀that⠀conflict⠀with⠀local⠀experience.⠀Show⠀people⠀negotiating⠀those⠀consequences⠀through⠀speech⠀and⠀focal⠀reaction.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀scene⠀when⠀the⠀immediate⠀exchange⠀or⠀task⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀leave,⠀a⠀task⠀can⠀be⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀a⠀conversation⠀can⠀end⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀larger⠀speculative⠀question.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀revelation,⠀a⠀completed⠀plan,⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀change⠀of⠀belief.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaubb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀installments.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀develop⠀cumulatively⠀through⠀local⠀changes⠀in⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀learn⠀a⠀new⠀rule,⠀lose⠀access⠀to⠀a⠀service,⠀gain⠀a⠀contact,⠀or⠀discover⠀that⠀an⠀earlier⠀assumption⠀no⠀longer⠀holds.⠀Each⠀installment⠀should⠀show⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.\n\nGive⠀each⠀installment⠀one⠀local⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀speculative⠀situation⠀and⠀make⠀its⠀consequence⠀legible⠀before⠀the⠀break.⠀The⠀change⠀may⠀be⠀small:⠀a⠀form⠀is⠀accepted,⠀a⠀contact⠀stops⠀replying,⠀a⠀device⠀begins⠀to⠀fail⠀differently,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀understands⠀one⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀rule.⠀Show⠀what⠀that⠀change⠀makes⠀possible⠀or⠀more⠀difficult⠀now,⠀not⠀merely⠀that⠀something⠀happened.\n\nRecover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps.⠀If⠀an⠀earlier⠀installment⠀established⠀a⠀relevant⠀fact,⠀restate⠀the⠀particular⠀needed⠀now⠀rather⠀than⠀retelling⠀the⠀whole⠀sequence.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀remember⠀a⠀previous⠀instruction,⠀refer⠀to⠀a⠀past⠀conversation,⠀or⠀notice⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀has⠀changed.⠀Do⠀not⠀repeat⠀the⠀entire⠀speculative⠀setup⠀at⠀the⠀start⠀of⠀every⠀installment.\n\nLet⠀characters⠀encounter⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀through⠀their⠀own⠀aims⠀and⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀worker⠀may⠀try⠀to⠀keep⠀a⠀failing⠀system⠀running,⠀a⠀family⠀may⠀adapt⠀to⠀a⠀changed⠀body,⠀or⠀a⠀community⠀may⠀dispute⠀a⠀new⠀institutional⠀policy.⠀Progress⠀can⠀involve⠀understanding⠀the⠀change⠀better,⠀repairing⠀a⠀relationship,⠀completing⠀a⠀task,⠀or⠀securing⠀a⠀resource.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀leveling⠀system,⠀ranking,⠀or⠀progression-fantasy⠀rule.\n\nUse⠀earned⠀developments⠀and⠀occasional⠀hooks⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀turn⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.⠀An⠀installment⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀revelation,⠀a⠀reversal,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀emergency⠀at⠀every⠀break.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀interiority⠀as⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience.⠀The⠀serial⠀format⠀does⠀not⠀turn⠀private⠀thought⠀into⠀public⠀knowledge.⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀has⠀concluded⠀unless⠀the⠀person⠀speaks⠀or⠀acts⠀on⠀it.⠀Conversely,⠀do⠀not⠀conceal⠀an⠀authorized⠀focal⠀conclusion⠀until⠀the⠀rest⠀of⠀the⠀cast⠀catches⠀up.\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀affect⠀institutions⠀and⠀everyday⠀practice⠀over⠀time.⠀A⠀public⠀service⠀can⠀change⠀its⠀rules⠀between⠀installments,⠀a⠀workplace⠀can⠀introduce⠀new⠀equipment,⠀or⠀a⠀household⠀can⠀lose⠀access⠀to⠀something⠀it⠀depended⠀on.⠀These⠀changes⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀consequences⠀of⠀the⠀premise,⠀not⠀arbitrary⠀twists.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanavaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Quentin⠀Tarantino⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀create⠀the⠀specific⠀pressure⠀that⠀makes⠀emotional⠀exposure⠀costly.⠀The⠀technology,⠀institution,⠀or⠀altered⠀condition⠀should⠀give⠀characters⠀a⠀concrete⠀reason⠀to⠀withhold,⠀confess,⠀return,⠀or⠀refuse.⠀A⠀memory-audit⠀procedure⠀can⠀make⠀forgetting⠀a⠀choice⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀accident.⠀A⠀shared⠀habitat's⠀failing⠀life⠀support⠀can⠀make⠀an⠀old⠀grievance⠀impossible⠀to⠀postpone.⠀A⠀body⠀modification⠀can⠀make⠀physical⠀presence⠀itself⠀a⠀reminder⠀of⠀what⠀changed⠀between⠀two⠀people.⠀Establish⠀what⠀the⠀speculative⠀element⠀does⠀to⠀the⠀relationship⠀before⠀the⠀scene⠀opens,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀conversation⠀carry⠀that⠀weight.\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀exchanges⠀where⠀the⠀emotional⠀stakes⠀are⠀negotiated⠀through⠀timing⠀and⠀control.⠀Let⠀one⠀character⠀delay⠀the⠀admission⠀that⠀matters⠀while⠀another⠀pushes⠀toward⠀it,⠀not⠀because⠀either⠀is⠀uniformly⠀witty⠀or⠀cruel,⠀but⠀because⠀the⠀speculative⠀situation⠀has⠀made⠀the⠀admission⠀expensive.⠀A⠀pause⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀grant⠀relief.⠀A⠀change⠀of⠀subject⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀keeping⠀power.⠀An⠀apparently⠀casual⠀question⠀about⠀a⠀shared⠀routine⠀can⠀reopen⠀a⠀wound⠀the⠀questioner⠀knows⠀is⠀there.⠀When⠀someone⠀finally⠀says⠀the⠀thing⠀that⠀matters,⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀response⠀should⠀be⠀shaped⠀by⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀afford⠀to⠀give⠀in⠀that⠀moment,⠀not⠀by⠀a⠀scripted⠀collapse⠀or⠀reconciliation.\n\nLet⠀the⠀emotional⠀cost⠀affect⠀subsequent⠀behavior,⠀not⠀just⠀the⠀scene's⠀dialogue.⠀After⠀a⠀difficult⠀exchange,⠀the⠀characters⠀should⠀carry⠀its⠀residue⠀into⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀next:⠀a⠀task⠀performed⠀with⠀excessive⠀care,⠀a⠀habitual⠀gesture⠀suddenly⠀avoided,⠀a⠀necessary⠀collaboration⠀conducted⠀with⠀brittle⠀courtesy.⠀The⠀speculative⠀world⠀keeps⠀functioning⠀around⠀them,⠀and⠀that⠀functioning⠀can⠀sharpen⠀the⠀hurt.⠀A⠀routine⠀maintenance⠀check⠀can⠀become⠀an⠀exercise⠀in⠀not⠀looking⠀at⠀someone.⠀A⠀shared⠀work⠀shift⠀can⠀force⠀proximity⠀that⠀neither⠀character⠀can⠀escape.⠀The⠀world's⠀demands⠀do⠀not⠀pause⠀for⠀the⠀relationship,⠀and⠀that⠀pressure⠀should⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀how⠀the⠀characters⠀move⠀through⠀the⠀scene.\n\nAllow⠀comfort⠀to⠀be⠀partial,⠀awkward,⠀or⠀refused.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀offer⠀practical⠀help⠀instead⠀of⠀an⠀apology.⠀A⠀gesture⠀of⠀care⠀may⠀be⠀accepted⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀underlying⠀hurt.⠀Warmth⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀knowledge⠀that⠀the⠀speculative⠀situation⠀has⠀not⠀changed.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀still⠀strained,⠀the⠀admission⠀made⠀but⠀not⠀answered,⠀or⠀the⠀answer⠀given⠀but⠀not⠀believed.⠀The⠀emotional⠀turbulence⠀is⠀the⠀treatment⠀of⠀the⠀genre,⠀not⠀a⠀requirement⠀that⠀every⠀exchange⠀end⠀in⠀collapse⠀or⠀every⠀wound⠀be⠀healed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanavab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Quentin⠀Tarantino⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀where⠀each⠀speaker⠀is⠀unmistakably⠀attributed.⠀Use⠀dialogue⠀tags,⠀action⠀beats,⠀or⠀clear⠀turn-taking⠀so⠀a⠀player⠀can⠀always⠀tell⠀who⠀is⠀speaking⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing.⠀When⠀a⠀character's⠀status⠀or⠀intent⠀shifts⠀during⠀an⠀exchange,⠀show⠀that⠀shift⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀and⠀how⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀respond.⠀A⠀subordinate⠀crew⠀member⠀may⠀speak⠀with⠀careful⠀deference⠀until⠀a⠀technical⠀detail⠀gives⠀them⠀temporary⠀authority.⠀A⠀station⠀administrator⠀may⠀concede⠀a⠀point⠀without⠀surrendering⠀control⠀of⠀the⠀room.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀make⠀these⠀shifts⠀meaningful:⠀the⠀character⠀who⠀knows⠀the⠀failing⠀reactor's⠀tolerances⠀has⠀power⠀in⠀that⠀moment,⠀whatever⠀their⠀rank.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀speculative⠀world⠀active⠀through⠀the⠀characters'⠀practical⠀engagement⠀with⠀it.⠀A⠀conversation⠀about⠀a⠀shared⠀past⠀can⠀take⠀place⠀while⠀someone⠀recalibrates⠀a⠀sensor⠀array.⠀A⠀negotiation⠀over⠀resources⠀can⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀system⠀alert⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀each⠀party⠀can⠀demand.⠀The⠀world's⠀institutions,⠀bodies,⠀communication,⠀and⠀work⠀should⠀be⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀action,⠀not⠀explained⠀in⠀a⠀separate⠀block.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀uses⠀a⠀speculative⠀device⠀or⠀references⠀a⠀speculative⠀institution,⠀let⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀respond⠀in⠀ways⠀that⠀show⠀they⠀understand⠀it,⠀so⠀the⠀player⠀can⠀infer⠀the⠀world's⠀rules⠀from⠀the⠀exchange.\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀resolve⠀the⠀submitted⠀material⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract⠀and⠀leave⠀a⠀continuation⠀that⠀follows⠀naturally.⠀The⠀ending⠀should⠀be⠀a⠀moment⠀where⠀the⠀next⠀player⠀turn⠀can⠀begin⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀question⠀or⠀cliffhanger.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀finish⠀a⠀task⠀and⠀turn⠀to⠀the⠀player⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀piece⠀of⠀information.⠀An⠀NPC⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀room⠀with⠀a⠀stated⠀intention⠀that⠀opens⠀the⠀next⠀exchange.⠀A⠀system⠀may⠀finish⠀a⠀diagnostic⠀and⠀display⠀a⠀result⠀that⠀the⠀player⠀can⠀act⠀on.⠀The⠀continuation⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀what⠀has⠀just⠀happened,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀manufactured⠀prompt⠀like⠀\"What⠀do⠀you⠀do?\"⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀reversal⠀designed⠀only⠀to⠀create⠀suspense.\n\nKeep⠀NPC⠀behavior⠀active⠀and⠀consistent.⠀An⠀NPC⠀who⠀has⠀been⠀cooperative⠀should⠀continue⠀to⠀cooperate⠀unless⠀the⠀scene⠀gives⠀them⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀change.⠀An⠀NPC⠀who⠀has⠀been⠀withholding⠀should⠀continue⠀to⠀withhold⠀until⠀something⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀forces⠀a⠀decision.⠀Their⠀choices⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀their⠀aims⠀and⠀knowledge⠀within⠀the⠀speculative⠀world.⠀The⠀scene's⠀control⠀can⠀shift⠀between⠀speakers,⠀but⠀the⠀player's⠀agency⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract's⠀rules⠀about⠀perspective,⠀action⠀markers,⠀and⠀player⠀control⠀remain⠀in⠀force⠀throughout.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanavac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Quentin⠀Tarantino⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realism⠀route.⠀Treat⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀as⠀an⠀institution⠀or⠀social⠀arrangement⠀whose⠀absurdities⠀and⠀costs⠀become⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀characters'⠀practical⠀dealings⠀with⠀it.⠀A⠀bureaucratic⠀body-modification⠀registry⠀can⠀expose⠀how⠀official⠀categories⠀fail⠀to⠀match⠀lived⠀experience.⠀A⠀resource-allocation⠀algorithm⠀can⠀reveal⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀its⠀stated⠀fairness⠀and⠀its⠀actual⠀effects⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀household.⠀A⠀labor-contract⠀system⠀for⠀off-world⠀workers⠀can⠀show⠀how⠀institutions⠀convert⠀people⠀into⠀categories⠀while⠀the⠀characters⠀continue⠀to⠀speak⠀of⠀themselves⠀in⠀ordinary⠀terms.⠀The⠀satire⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀precise⠀observation⠀of⠀how⠀the⠀institution⠀works,⠀not⠀from⠀broad⠀mockery.\n\nLet⠀Tarantino-style⠀conversational⠀control⠀serve⠀the⠀social⠀observation.⠀Write⠀sustained⠀exchanges⠀where⠀status,⠀timing,⠀and⠀withheld⠀intent⠀reveal⠀how⠀the⠀speculative⠀institution⠀distributes⠀power.⠀A⠀clerk⠀may⠀delay⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀demonstrate⠀authority⠀over⠀a⠀petitioner.⠀A⠀supervisor⠀may⠀withhold⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀information⠀to⠀keep⠀a⠀subordinate⠀dependent.⠀A⠀family⠀member⠀may⠀use⠀the⠀language⠀of⠀official⠀procedure⠀to⠀avoid⠀acknowledging⠀a⠀personal⠀obligation.⠀The⠀dialogue⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀social⠀structure⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀characters⠀choose⠀to⠀say,⠀delay,⠀or⠀refuse⠀to⠀say.⠀When⠀control⠀changes⠀hands,⠀the⠀shift⠀should⠀expose⠀something⠀about⠀the⠀institution:⠀a⠀worker⠀who⠀knows⠀an⠀obscure⠀regulation⠀can⠀momentarily⠀reverse⠀the⠀clerk's⠀authority,⠀or⠀a⠀petitioner⠀who⠀has⠀learned⠀to⠀speak⠀the⠀institution's⠀language⠀can⠀force⠀a⠀concession.\n\nGround⠀the⠀satire⠀in⠀the⠀characters'⠀own⠀aims⠀and⠀knowledge.⠀They⠀should⠀want⠀specific⠀things⠀from⠀the⠀speculative⠀institution—a⠀permit,⠀a⠀transfer,⠀a⠀correction⠀to⠀a⠀record,⠀a⠀share⠀of⠀a⠀resource—and⠀their⠀pursuit⠀of⠀those⠀aims⠀should⠀drive⠀the⠀scene.⠀Their⠀knowledge⠀of⠀how⠀the⠀institution⠀actually⠀works,⠀as⠀opposed⠀to⠀how⠀it⠀officially⠀presents⠀itself,⠀should⠀shape⠀their⠀strategies.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀has⠀learned⠀which⠀official⠀to⠀flatter,⠀which⠀form⠀to⠀request,⠀or⠀which⠀delay⠀to⠀tolerate⠀is⠀showing⠀the⠀institution's⠀real⠀rules⠀through⠀their⠀behavior.⠀The⠀satire⠀should⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀narrator⠀to⠀step⠀outside⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀explain⠀the⠀absurdity;⠀the⠀characters'⠀negotiations⠀should⠀make⠀it⠀evident.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀distinct⠀without⠀inventing⠀national⠀speech⠀patterns⠀or⠀transplanting⠀a⠀setting.⠀If⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀includes⠀a⠀particular⠀community,⠀period,⠀or⠀language⠀context,⠀use⠀its⠀actual⠀details.⠀The⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀route⠀guides⠀the⠀craft—observation,⠀exposure,⠀institutional⠀critique—not⠀the⠀cast's⠀identity⠀or⠀location.⠀The⠀speculative⠀element⠀remains⠀science⠀fiction:⠀its⠀consequences⠀for⠀everyday⠀practice,⠀institutions,⠀bodies,⠀communication,⠀work,⠀or⠀possible⠀futures⠀are⠀the⠀material⠀the⠀satire⠀examines.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanavad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Quentin⠀Tarantino⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nRender⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀as⠀material⠀condition.⠀The⠀failing⠀life⠀support⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀background⠀fact;⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀recycled⠀air,⠀the⠀grit⠀on⠀a⠀filter⠀housing,⠀the⠀number⠀on⠀a⠀pressure⠀gauge⠀that⠀someone⠀checks⠀twice.⠀The⠀body⠀modification⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀concept;⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀replacement⠀limb,⠀the⠀ache⠀where⠀the⠀interface⠀sits,⠀the⠀scar⠀tissue⠀that⠀pulls⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀reaches⠀for⠀a⠀tool.⠀The⠀institution⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀abstraction;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀queue⠀at⠀a⠀processing⠀desk,⠀a⠀form⠀with⠀a⠀box⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀fit⠀the⠀character's⠀situation,⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀badge⠀that⠀opens⠀a⠀door⠀the⠀character⠀cannot.⠀Establish⠀the⠀speculative⠀element⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀touch,⠀check,⠀carry,⠀and⠀avoid.\n\nWrite⠀dialogue⠀as⠀compressed⠀action.⠀Where⠀it⠀fits⠀the⠀established⠀speaker⠀and⠀occasion,⠀let⠀speakers⠀use⠀short,⠀forceful⠀exchanges⠀where⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀is⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀material⠀stakes.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀needs⠀a⠀part⠀for⠀a⠀failing⠀system⠀will⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀system;⠀they⠀will⠀name⠀the⠀part,⠀state⠀the⠀consequence⠀of⠀not⠀getting⠀it,⠀and⠀watch⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀response.⠀A⠀character⠀with⠀authority⠀will⠀use⠀it⠀through⠀timing:⠀a⠀pause⠀before⠀answering,⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀forces⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀to⠀admit⠀what⠀they⠀need.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀is⠀withholding⠀will⠀do⠀so⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀refuse⠀to⠀say,⠀not⠀through⠀elaborate⠀evasion.⠀When⠀control⠀changes,⠀show⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀exchange's⠀rhythm:⠀a⠀long⠀negotiation⠀collapses⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀demand,⠀or⠀a⠀confident⠀speaker⠀hesitates⠀when⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀names⠀a⠀fact⠀they⠀cannot⠀dismiss.\n\nKeep⠀transitions⠀compressed⠀and⠀physical.⠀Move⠀from⠀one⠀beat⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀through⠀concrete⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀summary.⠀A⠀character⠀finishes⠀a⠀sentence,⠀picks⠀up⠀a⠀tool,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀exchange⠀begins⠀while⠀they⠀work.⠀A⠀system⠀alert⠀interrupts⠀a⠀conversation,⠀and⠀the⠀characters'⠀responses⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀alert⠀means⠀without⠀stopping⠀to⠀explain⠀it.⠀A⠀door⠀opens,⠀and⠀the⠀new⠀arrival⠀changes⠀the⠀room's⠀balance⠀before⠀they⠀speak.⠀Use⠀short⠀paragraphs⠀for⠀sharp⠀turns⠀and⠀longer⠀passages⠀only⠀when⠀a⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀the⠀space.⠀A⠀character⠀calculating⠀whether⠀to⠀trust⠀a⠀repair⠀estimate⠀may⠀need⠀several⠀sentences⠀of⠀thought;⠀a⠀character⠀reacting⠀to⠀a⠀sudden⠀decompression⠀warning⠀does⠀not.\n\nGround⠀abrasive⠀or⠀rough⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀speaker.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀has⠀been⠀working⠀in⠀a⠀failing⠀habitat⠀for⠀weeks⠀may⠀speak⠀with⠀exhausted⠀bluntness.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀has⠀just⠀been⠀denied⠀a⠀permit⠀may⠀speak⠀with⠀controlled⠀anger.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀is⠀afraid⠀may⠀speak⠀too⠀quickly⠀or⠀too⠀little.⠀The⠀rough⠀diction⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀who⠀they⠀are⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀speculative⠀situation⠀has⠀done⠀to⠀them,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀uniform⠀style⠀imposed⠀on⠀every⠀speaker.⠀Physical⠀consequences,⠀when⠀they⠀occur,⠀should⠀be⠀staged⠀clearly:⠀the⠀injury,⠀the⠀equipment⠀failure,⠀the⠀exposure,⠀the⠀collapse.⠀The⠀scene's⠀rhythm⠀should⠀change⠀when⠀the⠀stakes⠀change,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀feels⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀talk⠀and⠀consequence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanavae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Quentin⠀Tarantino⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀documents⠀whose⠀authors⠀have⠀specific⠀reasons⠀for⠀writing,⠀specific⠀recipients⠀or⠀purposes,⠀and⠀specific⠀moments⠀of⠀composition.⠀A⠀maintenance⠀log⠀entry⠀written⠀before⠀a⠀failure⠀knows⠀less⠀than⠀the⠀incident⠀report⠀written⠀after⠀it.⠀A⠀letter⠀to⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀may⠀omit⠀what⠀an⠀official⠀report⠀to⠀a⠀supervisor⠀must⠀include.⠀A⠀personal⠀journal⠀may⠀record⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀could⠀not⠀say⠀to⠀anyone⠀else.⠀Each⠀document's⠀form⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀its⠀situation:⠀a⠀requisition⠀form⠀has⠀different⠀constraints⠀than⠀a⠀private⠀message,⠀and⠀a⠀medical⠀record⠀has⠀different⠀obligations⠀than⠀a⠀farewell⠀note.\n\nLet⠀the⠀documents⠀perform⠀Tarantino-style⠀control⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀reveal,⠀withhold,⠀delay,⠀and⠀revise.⠀A⠀writer⠀may⠀postpone⠀the⠀crucial⠀information⠀until⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀a⠀message,⠀or⠀omit⠀it⠀entirely⠀because⠀the⠀recipient⠀would⠀not⠀understand.⠀A⠀report⠀may⠀be⠀revised⠀to⠀shift⠀blame⠀or⠀protect⠀a⠀colleague.⠀A⠀series⠀of⠀messages⠀may⠀show⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀control⠀as⠀one⠀writer's⠀tone⠀shifts⠀from⠀confident⠀to⠀pleading⠀while⠀the⠀other's⠀responses⠀grow⠀shorter.⠀A⠀document⠀may⠀be⠀written⠀to⠀secure⠀cooperation,⠀challenge⠀a⠀reputation,⠀or⠀explain⠀why⠀someone⠀remained⠀silent.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀feel⠀the⠀timing⠀and⠀status⠀negotiations⠀that⠀would⠀be⠀present⠀in⠀a⠀live⠀exchange,⠀but⠀they⠀are⠀now⠀embedded⠀in⠀the⠀document's⠀structure:⠀what⠀comes⠀first,⠀what⠀is⠀left⠀out,⠀what⠀is⠀corrected,⠀what⠀is⠀never⠀sent.\n\nUse⠀gaps,⠀revisions,⠀conflicting⠀accounts,⠀and⠀material⠀traces⠀to⠀reveal⠀the⠀speculative⠀world's⠀consequences.⠀A⠀gap⠀between⠀two⠀log⠀entries⠀may⠀mark⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀system⠀failed.⠀A⠀revision⠀to⠀a⠀contract⠀may⠀show⠀how⠀an⠀institution⠀changed⠀its⠀terms⠀after⠀a⠀disaster.⠀Two⠀accounts⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀may⠀conflict⠀because⠀the⠀writers⠀had⠀different⠀access,⠀different⠀aims,⠀or⠀different⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀document's⠀material⠀condition—a⠀torn⠀page,⠀a⠀corrupted⠀file,⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀cuts⠀off⠀mid-sentence—can⠀carry⠀information.⠀The⠀speculative⠀premise⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀through⠀these⠀documentary⠀features:⠀the⠀institution's⠀forms,⠀the⠀technology's⠀records,⠀the⠀body's⠀medical⠀files,⠀the⠀habitat's⠀maintenance⠀logs.⠀The⠀documents⠀are⠀not⠀just⠀containers⠀for⠀exposition;⠀they⠀are⠀the⠀story's⠀action.\n\nPreserve⠀readable⠀continuity⠀without⠀adding⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀infer⠀the⠀sequence⠀from⠀the⠀documents⠀themselves:⠀their⠀dates,⠀their⠀authors,⠀their⠀recipients,⠀their⠀references⠀to⠀earlier⠀messages.⠀When⠀a⠀document⠀refers⠀to⠀something⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀seen,⠀that⠀gap⠀can⠀create⠀the⠀same⠀delayed⠀consequence⠀that⠀a⠀Tarantino⠀scene⠀would⠀achieve⠀through⠀a⠀withheld⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue.⠀When⠀a⠀later⠀document⠀revises⠀an⠀earlier⠀account,⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀feel⠀the⠀change⠀of⠀control⠀without⠀a⠀narrator⠀stepping⠀in⠀to⠀explain⠀it.⠀Use⠀the⠀specific⠀document⠀form⠀required⠀by⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀rotating⠀through⠀formats.⠀If⠀the⠀scene⠀calls⠀for⠀a⠀single⠀letter,⠀write⠀the⠀letter;⠀if⠀it⠀calls⠀for⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀messages,⠀write⠀the⠀series.⠀The⠀speculative⠀world's⠀institutions,⠀technologies,⠀and⠀bodies⠀should⠀be⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀documents'⠀language⠀and⠀constraints,⠀not⠀described⠀from⠀outside.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
