hat⠀people⠀actually⠀call⠀it.\n\nDo⠀not⠀make⠀thought⠀a⠀universal⠀dialect⠀shared⠀by⠀all⠀characters.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀authorizes⠀another⠀person's⠀interiority⠀later,⠀accelerate⠀only⠀through⠀that⠀authorized⠀boundary.⠀Private⠀words⠀may⠀differ⠀from⠀spoken⠀words⠀for⠀character-specific⠀reasons:⠀caution,⠀exhaustion,⠀embarrassment,⠀utility,⠀or⠀a⠀relationship.⠀They⠀may⠀also⠀match.⠀Keep⠀causal⠀interiority⠀legible:⠀a⠀later⠀decision⠀may⠀follow⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀perception⠀or⠀recurring⠀concern,⠀but⠀earlier⠀motives⠀cannot⠀be⠀replaced⠀by⠀a⠀delayed⠀rationalization.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀duration⠀and⠀event⠀order⠀even⠀when⠀syntax⠀jumps.⠀A⠀queue⠀that⠀takes⠀ten⠀minutes⠀should⠀not⠀feel⠀as⠀if⠀a⠀single⠀thought⠀erased⠀ten⠀minutes;⠀waiting,⠀footsteps,⠀and⠀the⠀return⠀of⠀another⠀sound⠀can⠀interrupt⠀the⠀mind.⠀End⠀while⠀thought,⠀speech,⠀action,⠀or⠀waiting⠀continues.⠀A⠀realization,⠀changed⠀plan,⠀task⠀completion,⠀or⠀resumed⠀business⠀is⠀not⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀stops.⠀The⠀stream⠀method⠀must⠀remain⠀genuine⠀associative⠀movement⠀through⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern,⠀not⠀ordinary⠀linear⠀reasoning⠀lightly⠀decorated⠀with⠀italics.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanayaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nUse⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀as⠀the⠀main⠀story⠀surface.⠀Let⠀differences⠀in⠀typing⠀style,⠀capitalization,⠀completeness,⠀and⠀response⠀speed⠀carry⠀social⠀position.⠀A⠀supervisor⠀may⠀forward⠀the⠀official⠀announcement⠀unchanged;⠀a⠀technician⠀may⠀reply⠀with⠀three⠀shorthand⠀words;⠀a⠀new⠀employee⠀may⠀send⠀a⠀careful⠀question⠀and⠀then⠀watch⠀the⠀delay⠀stretch.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀should⠀emerge⠀through⠀the⠀channel⠀itself:⠀a⠀system⠀asks⠀for⠀an⠀unusual⠀confirmation,⠀a⠀timestamp⠀is⠀corrected⠀after⠀an⠀hours-long⠀error,⠀someone⠀tries⠀to⠀send⠀the⠀same⠀request⠀twice,⠀or⠀a⠀vital⠀photo⠀is⠀too⠀damaged⠀by⠀compression⠀to⠀be⠀useful.⠀Keep⠀these⠀interface⠀events⠀functional,⠀not⠀decorative.\n\nTreat⠀sent⠀messages⠀differently⠀from⠀drafts⠀and⠀private⠀thought.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀whose⠀author⠀chose⠀not⠀to⠀transmit⠀it;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀live⠀mental⠀experience.⠀If⠀required⠀interiority⠀belongs⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀present⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀separated⠀piece⠀of⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀format⠀rather⠀than⠀passing⠀it⠀off⠀as⠀a⠀draft⠀or⠀transmitted⠀line.⠀Never⠀pretend⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀read⠀someone's⠀private⠀thought⠀because⠀the⠀transcript⠀shows⠀only⠀typed⠀exchange.\n\nLet⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀belong⠀to⠀each⠀person.⠀One⠀may⠀use⠀voice⠀transcription⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀wrong⠀word,⠀another⠀may⠀send⠀two⠀careful⠀sentences⠀and⠀edit⠀the⠀second⠀after⠀seeing⠀'read'⠀appear,⠀another⠀may⠀answer⠀only⠀with⠀a⠀timestamped⠀yes.⠀Rank⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀who⠀gets⠀cc'd,⠀who⠀is⠀left⠀out,⠀who⠀replies⠀all⠀by⠀accident,⠀or⠀who⠀politely⠀ignores⠀a⠀direct⠀question.⠀A⠀Pratchett-style⠀correction⠀is⠀best⠀when⠀a⠀particular⠀mismatch—say⠀between⠀an⠀official⠀term⠀and⠀the⠀word⠀everyone⠀at⠀the⠀actual⠀worksite⠀uses—becomes⠀visible⠀without⠀any⠀character⠀making⠀a⠀balanced⠀satirical⠀speech.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀pause⠀to⠀carry⠀guilt⠀or⠀every⠀read⠀receipt⠀to⠀signal⠀hostility.⠀A⠀delayed⠀answer⠀may⠀mean⠀work,⠀caution,⠀annoyance,⠀a⠀poor⠀signal,⠀or⠀simply⠀that⠀the⠀person⠀is⠀looking⠀for⠀the⠀right⠀number.⠀Keep⠀what⠀is⠀transmitted⠀reliable⠀about⠀its⠀sender's⠀choices,⠀not⠀automatically⠀diagnostic⠀of⠀emotion.⠀Stop⠀at⠀a⠀legible⠀exchange:⠀a⠀message⠀left⠀on⠀read,⠀a⠀task⠀request⠀answered⠀with⠀partial⠀information,⠀an⠀attachment⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀open,⠀or⠀someone⠀typing⠀again.⠀The⠀response⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀closure,⠀an⠀edit,⠀a⠀reveal,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀change⠀before⠀it⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanayba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nSet⠀each⠀scene⠀compactly⠀enough⠀for⠀an⠀illustrated⠀frame:⠀a⠀changed⠀office⠀with⠀its⠀old⠀clock⠀left⠀behind,⠀a⠀public⠀square⠀where⠀a⠀new⠀delivery⠀channel⠀has⠀redrawn⠀the⠀morning⠀walk,⠀a⠀supply⠀room⠀reorganised⠀around⠀a⠀colder⠀standard.⠀Then⠀let⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀and⠀focal⠀prose⠀show⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀reads⠀what⠀they⠀see.⠀A⠀background⠀may⠀be⠀pristine⠀while⠀the⠀practical⠀equipment⠀is⠀worn;⠀a⠀posted⠀diagram⠀may⠀look⠀official⠀beside⠀a⠀technician's⠀handwritten⠀correction.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀should⠀register⠀through⠀those⠀discrepancies⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀paragraph⠀explaining⠀the⠀society's⠀technological⠀history.\n\nUse⠀a⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀as⠀an⠀orientation,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀guaranteed⠀emotional⠀or⠀moral⠀signal.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀smile⠀because⠀they⠀have⠀just⠀remembered⠀a⠀name,⠀may⠀look⠀grim⠀because⠀of⠀hunger,⠀may⠀go⠀still⠀because⠀they⠀are⠀reading.⠀If⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀infers⠀something,⠀allow⠀that⠀inference⠀to⠀be⠀supported,⠀revised,⠀or⠀left⠀unsettled⠀by⠀the⠀next⠀exchange.⠀Keep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀not⠀as⠀dialogue⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀cast⠀and⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀unreadable⠀aesthetic⠀label⠀attached⠀to⠀every⠀line.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Pratchett⠀social⠀attention⠀pass⠀through⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀relationships.⠀One⠀character⠀knows⠀where⠀the⠀spare⠀part⠀lives⠀even⠀though⠀no⠀form⠀mentions⠀it.⠀Another⠀repeats⠀the⠀new⠀warning⠀exactly⠀because⠀their⠀job⠀depends⠀on⠀sounding⠀correct.⠀A⠀third⠀cannot⠀understand⠀why⠀everyone⠀treats⠀a⠀minor⠀repair⠀as⠀official⠀progress.⠀Humor⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀such⠀particular⠀situations,⠀not⠀from⠀equal-opportunity⠀quips.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀executable⠀engine⠀code,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀a⠀reasonable⠀presentation⠀boundary:⠀after⠀a⠀line⠀and⠀a⠀small⠀reaction,⠀during⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀continues,⠀or⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀before⠀another⠀person⠀enters.⠀No⠀required⠀choice⠀screen,⠀discovery⠀beat,⠀or⠀emotional⠀resolution⠀need⠀close⠀the⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaybb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀through-line⠀made⠀of⠀particular⠀civic⠀or⠀workplace⠀particulars⠀rather⠀than⠀constant⠀escalating⠀incidents.⠀Decide⠀what⠀is⠀underway:⠀a⠀new⠀barrier⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀parts⠀