supplied⠀world,⠀use⠀them,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanazaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nMake⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀exert⠀practical⠀pressure⠀on⠀a⠀relationship⠀whose⠀participants⠀cannot⠀simply⠀escape⠀it.⠀The⠀science-fictional⠀change⠀should⠀be⠀worked⠀into⠀daily⠀routine:⠀a⠀required⠀procedure,⠀a⠀monitored⠀condition,⠀an⠀institutional⠀deadline,⠀a⠀widespread⠀fear,⠀a⠀modified⠀body.⠀Let⠀that⠀pressure⠀surface⠀through⠀specific⠀stakes⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀general⠀oppressive⠀mood.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀need⠀something⠀the⠀other⠀cannot⠀safely⠀give,⠀or⠀may⠀give⠀something⠀the⠀other⠀cannot⠀accept.⠀The⠀premise⠀does⠀not⠀explain⠀away⠀that⠀difficulty;⠀it⠀sharpens⠀it.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀direct⠀inquiry⠀to⠀strip⠀away⠀the⠀consoling⠀version⠀of⠀the⠀situation.⠀When⠀an⠀institution⠀says⠀the⠀procedure⠀is⠀for⠀their⠀own⠀good,⠀examine⠀what⠀it⠀costs.⠀When⠀someone⠀offers⠀a⠀kind⠀lie,⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀notice⠀what⠀it⠀avoids.⠀A⠀speaker's⠀candor⠀can⠀be⠀precise⠀and⠀even⠀irreverent⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀story⠀into⠀a⠀rant.⠀The⠀turbulence⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀characters:⠀what⠀they⠀admit,⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀say,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀after⠀speaking.⠀Let⠀a⠀painful⠀truth⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀specific⠀sentence⠀in⠀an⠀actual⠀conversation,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀thematic⠀announcement.\n\nGive⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀enough⠀private⠀thought⠀to⠀show⠀what⠀an⠀admission⠀or⠀refusal⠀is⠀costing.⠀The⠀thought⠀may⠀be⠀slower⠀and⠀more⠀deliberate⠀than⠀the⠀spoken⠀reply,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀precede⠀speech⠀and⠀be⠀abandoned⠀when⠀the⠀moment⠀arrives.⠀Keep⠀that⠀interiority⠀inside⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀knowledge;⠀other⠀participants⠀can⠀only⠀respond⠀to⠀what⠀they⠀see⠀and⠀hear.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession,⠀rupture,⠀or⠀reconciliation.⠀Warmth⠀and⠀common⠀practical⠀work⠀may⠀coexist⠀with⠀residual⠀anger,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀exchange⠀may⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀unresolved⠀difficulty⠀rather⠀than⠀resolve⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanazab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀a⠀single⠀shared⠀interval⠀of⠀the⠀science-fictional