w⠀space,⠀let⠀the⠀narrative⠀carry⠀the⠀social⠀or⠀historical⠀meaning⠀of⠀that⠀space⠀before⠀it⠀reports⠀the⠀immediate⠀action.⠀For⠀example,⠀a⠀corridor⠀that⠀once⠀led⠀to⠀the⠀public⠀clinic⠀may⠀now⠀terminate⠀at⠀a⠀permit⠀counter;⠀the⠀character's⠀walk⠀can⠀register⠀both⠀the⠀old⠀destination⠀and⠀the⠀new⠀institutional⠀fact⠀without⠀a⠀separate⠀information⠀dump.⠀Keep⠀the⠀sentences⠀controlled⠀and⠀syntactically⠀varied⠀rather⠀than⠀uniformly⠀short.\n\nFrame⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀through⠀social⠀relations⠀and⠀their⠀histories.⠀Show⠀how⠀a⠀rule⠀change⠀sits⠀differently⠀for⠀a⠀technician,⠀a⠀licensed⠀resident,⠀or⠀an⠀unregistered⠀child.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator,⠀if⠀authorized,⠀reflect⠀on⠀the⠀timing:⠀a⠀generation⠀that⠀once⠀welcomed⠀a⠀procedure⠀may⠀now⠀regard⠀the⠀next⠀adoption⠀as⠀reckless.⠀Such⠀reflection⠀must⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀and⠀its⠀knowledge;⠀an⠀omniscient⠀narrator⠀can⠀compare⠀periods,⠀while⠀a⠀limited⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀only⠀compare⠀memory⠀and⠀hearsay.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀physical⠀details⠀as⠀anchors⠀within⠀the⠀broader⠀narration.⠀Sustain⠀a⠀paragraph's⠀social⠀or⠀judicial⠀context,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀one⠀observed⠀surface:⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀comm⠀screen⠀reflecting⠀the⠀whole⠀corridor,⠀a⠀cup⠀pushed⠀against⠀the⠀rim⠀of⠀a⠀tray,⠀a⠀clerk's⠀gloved⠀finger⠀tracing⠀the⠀same⠀line⠀twice.⠀The⠀detail⠀should⠀condense⠀the⠀social⠀consequence⠀already⠀established⠀in⠀the⠀paragraph,⠀not⠀introduce⠀a⠀new⠀feeling:⠀the⠀clerk's⠀repeated⠀tracing⠀gathers⠀the⠀queue's⠀frustration,⠀the⠀cup⠀against⠀the⠀tray⠀gathers⠀the⠀resident's⠀exclusion⠀from⠀the⠀permit⠀counter.⠀The⠀detail⠀should⠀be⠀brief⠀and⠀not⠀multiply.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀its⠀full⠀meaning,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀every⠀socially⠀framed⠀passage⠀conclude⠀with⠀such⠀a⠀symbol;⠀otherwise⠀it⠀becomes⠀mechanical.\n\nRetain⠀private⠀interiority⠀where⠀the⠀contract⠀allows.⠀The⠀formal⠀distance⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀experience:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀about⠀the⠀fine⠀they⠀cannot⠀pay⠀while⠀they⠀describe⠀the⠀queue⠀correctly⠀to⠀a⠀neighbor.⠀Distinguish⠀memory⠀from⠀current⠀judgment.⠀In⠀a⠀flashback,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀noticed⠀then;⠀in⠀the⠀present,⠀show⠀what⠀they⠀now⠀understand⠀or⠀regret.⠀Do⠀not⠀retroactively⠀place⠀later⠀knowledge⠀into⠀earlier⠀perception.\n\nLet⠀transitions⠀serve⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀chapter-like⠀shift⠀can⠀close⠀an⠀interval⠀on⠀a⠀seemingly⠀incidental⠀image,⠀then⠀open⠀the⠀next⠀part⠀with⠀the⠀institutional⠀consequence⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀choice.⠀The⠀response⠀need⠀not⠀include⠀a⠀full⠀chapter⠀break,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀end⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀social⠀framing⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀advanced⠀and⠀the⠀emotional⠀surface⠀remains⠀open⠀for⠀the⠀user⠀or⠀writer⠀to⠀continue.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanbaah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀situated⠀telling⠀before⠀listeners⠀whose⠀present⠀circumstances⠀are⠀already⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀speculative⠀change.⠀The⠀outer⠀frame⠀should⠀contain⠀a⠀concrete⠀material⠀fact⠀that⠀the⠀listeners⠀can⠀observe⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀yet⠀fully⠀understand:⠀a⠀ration⠀mark,⠀a⠀repaired⠀limb,⠀a⠀signal⠀delay,⠀a⠀locked⠀route,⠀a⠀crop⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀keep.⠀The⠀teller⠀speaks⠀because⠀this⠀fact⠀bears⠀on⠀their⠀survival,⠀work,⠀or⠀loyalty,⠀and⠀the⠀telling⠀itself⠀is⠀an⠀intervention⠀in⠀that⠀present.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀teller⠀begins⠀a⠀nested⠀account,⠀make⠀the⠀inner⠀tale⠀follow⠀one⠀specific⠀consequence⠀of⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀through⠀a⠀particular⠀body⠀and⠀a⠀particular⠀place.⠀Do⠀not⠀summarize⠀the⠀change.⠀Show⠀a⠀person⠀waiting⠀at⠀a⠀checkpoint,⠀learning⠀to⠀use⠀a⠀new⠀hand,⠀hearing⠀a⠀voice⠀arrive⠀late,⠀or⠀discovering⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀now⠀means⠀something⠀else.⠀The⠀inner⠀tale⠀must⠀give⠀the⠀outer⠀listener⠀a⠀new⠀way⠀to⠀read⠀the⠀present⠀fact:⠀after⠀hearing⠀it,⠀the⠀listener⠀should⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀mark⠀is⠀older⠀than⠀claimed,⠀the⠀limb⠀moves⠀with⠀borrowed⠀rhythm,⠀the⠀signal⠀repeats⠀a⠀word⠀no⠀one⠀said,⠀or⠀the⠀locked⠀route⠀was⠀open⠀once.⠀Let⠀that⠀recognition⠀surface⠀in⠀the⠀frame⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀question,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀announced⠀theme.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀physical⠀impressions⠀to⠀mark⠀the⠀boundary⠀between⠀levels.⠀Choose⠀one⠀brief⠀sensory⠀image—a⠀white⠀surface,⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀cloth⠀lifting,⠀the⠀smell⠀after⠀rain,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀door⠀opens—and⠀let⠀it⠀reappear⠀when⠀the⠀inner⠀tale⠀touches⠀the⠀outer⠀fact.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀pressure,⠀not⠀explanation.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀partial,⠀mistaken,⠀protective,⠀or⠀deliberately⠀slow;⠀their⠀selection⠀of⠀what⠀to⠀evoke⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀world's⠀story,⠀and⠀a⠀listener⠀may⠀understand⠀the⠀tale⠀differently⠀from⠀its⠀teller.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀causally⠀active⠀in⠀both⠀levels.⠀The⠀inner⠀tale⠀is⠀not⠀decoration⠀or⠀delay;⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀listeners⠀can⠀do⠀next,⠀even⠀if⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀yet⠀act.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀tension⠀reaches⠀its⠀natural⠀pause—often⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀listener⠀recognizes⠀the⠀tale's⠀bearing⠀on⠀the⠀frame—without⠀forcing⠀a⠀completed⠀resolution⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanbaai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀or⠀developmental⠀realism⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀as⠀a⠀material⠀condition⠀that⠀has⠀already⠀reshaped⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀or⠀family⠀expectations.⠀Establish⠀the⠀narrator's⠀position⠀in⠀relation⠀to⠀that⠀condition:⠀a⠀worker⠀inside⠀a⠀system⠀knows⠀its⠀schedules⠀and⠀forms⠀from⠀daily⠀use;⠀a⠀child⠀observes⠀a⠀parent's⠀adaptation⠀without⠀yet⠀understanding⠀its⠀cost;⠀an⠀excluded⠀neighbor⠀reads⠀the⠀same⠀change⠀through⠀a⠀queue,⠀a⠀closed⠀gate,⠀or⠀a⠀sound⠀that⠀has⠀stopped.⠀Let⠀that⠀position⠀determine⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀outside⠀their⠀knowledge.\n\nShow⠀consequences⠀through⠀ordinary⠀transactions.⠀A⠀changed⠀checkpoint,⠀a⠀repaired⠀body⠀returning⠀to⠀work,⠀a⠀ration⠀form⠀filled⠀out⠀twice,⠀a⠀family⠀meal⠀reorganized⠀around⠀a⠀new⠀shift—these⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀without⠀allegory.⠀The⠀premise⠀remains⠀a⠀concrete⠀technical,⠀medical,⠀environmental,⠀or⠀economic⠀change⠀whose⠀costs⠀and⠀benefits⠀distribute⠀unevenly,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀practical⠀knowledge⠀reveals⠀that⠀unevenness⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀it.\n\nChoose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀sharp⠀physical⠀details⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀recur⠀with⠀altered⠀meaning.⠀The⠀cold⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀rail,⠀a⠀missing⠀name⠀on⠀a⠀list,⠀a⠀coat⠀folded⠀too⠀carefully—each⠀return⠀should⠀register⠀a⠀developmental⠀shift:⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀means⠀something⠀different⠀after⠀the⠀narrator⠀has⠀learned⠀a⠀rule,⠀lost⠀a⠀permission,⠀or⠀seen⠀a⠀parent's⠀hands⠀change.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀shift.⠀Let⠀the⠀repeated⠀detail⠀carry⠀feeling⠀through⠀its⠀new⠀context.\n\nKeep⠀thought⠀and⠀dialogue⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀narrator's⠀social⠀position.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀at⠀length⠀about⠀one⠀small⠀thing⠀while⠀leaving⠀another⠀unspoken⠀because⠀the⠀system⠀makes⠀it⠀dangerous,⠀useless,⠀or⠀too⠀private⠀to⠀say.⠀Where⠀the⠀story⠀specifies⠀a⠀language,⠀community,⠀or⠀historical⠀pressure,⠀keep⠀those⠀facts⠀concrete⠀and⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀decorative.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀developmental⠀tension⠀pauses⠀naturally,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀completed⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanbaaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nTreat⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀as⠀inherited⠀authority⠀operating⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀tense.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀legacy⠀charter,⠀a⠀preserved⠀elite,⠀an⠀old⠀infrastructure,⠀or⠀body⠀modifications⠀passed⠀down⠀as⠀obligation.⠀Let⠀it⠀function⠀now⠀through⠀permissions,⠀debt,⠀surveillance,⠀or⠀memory,⠀and⠀show⠀its⠀operation⠀in⠀city⠀textures⠀that⠀are⠀causally⠀active:⠀a⠀lift⠀that⠀reads⠀a⠀palm,⠀a⠀window⠀sealed⠀with⠀old⠀polymer,⠀a⠀garden⠀surviving⠀in⠀a⠀service⠀corridor.⠀Each⠀detail⠀should⠀affect⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀do,⠀enter,⠀or⠀hide.\n\nBuild⠀morally⠀complicated⠀intimacy⠀at⠀close⠀range.⠀Two⠀characters⠀may⠀care⠀for⠀each⠀other⠀while⠀serving⠀different⠀parts⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀system,⠀or⠀one⠀may⠀need⠀something⠀the⠀other⠀is⠀forbidden⠀to⠀give.⠀Show⠀private⠀desire⠀and⠀fear⠀through⠀small,⠀compressed⠀perceptions—a⠀hesitation⠀before⠀touching⠀a⠀console,⠀the⠀warmth⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀sleeve,⠀the⠀specific⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀name⠀spoken⠀in⠀an⠀almost⠀private⠀room.⠀Let⠀social⠀masks⠀relax⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀then⠀make⠀that⠀relaxation⠀reveal⠀a⠀present⠀cost:⠀a⠀debt⠀now⠀due,⠀a⠀body⠀part⠀now⠀tracked,⠀a⠀permission⠀now⠀revoked,⠀a⠀memory⠀now⠀shown⠀to⠀be⠀borrowed.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selectivity⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀horror⠀felt⠀through⠀what⠀is⠀withheld.⠀Choose⠀one⠀brief⠀sensory⠀detail—a⠀broken⠀seal,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀a⠀particular⠀warmth⠀or⠀coldness—and⠀let⠀it⠀appear⠀early⠀without⠀explanation.⠀When⠀the⠀intimate⠀exposure⠀arrives,⠀return⠀to⠀that⠀detail⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀what⠀it⠀already⠀signified.⠀The⠀recognition⠀should⠀be⠀concrete⠀and⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀speculative⠀system's⠀daily⠀operation,⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀mood.\n\nKeep⠀interiority⠀genuine:⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀suspicion,⠀hope,⠀shame,⠀and⠀intention⠀should⠀appear⠀as⠀private⠀experience⠀when⠀the⠀contract⠀permits.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀named⠀vampire⠀mechanics,⠀secret⠀powers,⠀or⠀an⠀omnipotent⠀institution⠀to⠀close⠀a⠀gap.⠀The⠀speculative⠀system⠀must⠀remain⠀intelligible⠀through⠀its⠀daily⠀operation,⠀and⠀the⠀horror⠀arises⠀when⠀that⠀operation⠀touches⠀an⠀intimate⠀life⠀and⠀makes⠀its⠀cost⠀visible.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanbaak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀the⠀lyric⠀or⠀philosophical⠀inwardness⠀route.⠀Write⠀from⠀the⠀close⠀experience⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀body,⠀family,⠀or⠀neighborhood⠀as⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀alters⠀something⠀formerly⠀stable:⠀work,⠀kinship⠀time,⠀water,⠀food,⠀a⠀shared⠀roof,⠀or⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀arrival⠀and⠀departure.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀when⠀supplied;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀symbol-system⠀beyond⠀the⠀story's⠀own⠀materials.\n\nLet⠀conceptual⠀pressure⠀gather⠀through⠀one⠀recurring⠀sensory⠀image.⠀Choose⠀a⠀brief⠀physical⠀fact—a⠀lamp's⠀reflection⠀in⠀a⠀wet⠀step,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀diesel⠀and⠀jasmine,⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀torn⠀schedule⠀pasted⠀by⠀a⠀door—and⠀let⠀it⠀return⠀at⠀three⠀moments.⠀The⠀first⠀return⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀character⠀noticing⠀the⠀image⠀without⠀understanding⠀its⠀connection⠀to⠀the⠀change.⠀The⠀second⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀image⠀inside⠀a⠀practical⠀consequence:⠀the⠀wet⠀step⠀now⠀means⠀a⠀ration⠀queue,⠀the⠀diesel⠀smell⠀now⠀means⠀a⠀work⠀shift,⠀the⠀torn⠀schedule⠀now⠀means⠀a⠀missed⠀arrival.⠀The⠀third⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀character⠀understanding⠀that⠀connection⠀without⠀announcing⠀it⠀in⠀general⠀terms.⠀Let⠀the⠀understanding⠀surface⠀as⠀a⠀small⠀action,⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀will⠀do⠀next.\n\nAttend⠀to⠀what⠀changes⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀kept.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀continue⠀a⠀small⠀ritual⠀even⠀when⠀its⠀material⠀context⠀has⠀become⠀uncertain,⠀and⠀that⠀effort⠀can⠀carry⠀loss,⠀stubbornness,⠀or⠀care.⠀Use⠀thought⠀as⠀the⠀primary⠀instrument,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀reduce⠀every⠀other⠀person⠀to⠀a⠀symbol.⠀Others⠀can⠀notice,⠀misunderstand,⠀resist,⠀help,⠀or⠀remain⠀privately⠀occupied;⠀their⠀presence⠀should⠀be⠀felt⠀through⠀reported⠀action⠀and⠀small⠀visual⠀facts,⠀not⠀flat⠀importance.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀concrete.⠀If⠀it⠀affects⠀water,⠀show⠀rationing⠀in⠀a⠀queue;⠀if⠀it⠀affects⠀work,⠀show⠀a⠀machine's⠀new⠀claim⠀on⠀a⠀body's⠀time;⠀if⠀it⠀affects⠀kinship,⠀show⠀who⠀waits⠀for⠀whom.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀recurring⠀image⠀has⠀completed⠀its⠀third⠀return⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀understanding⠀has⠀shifted,⠀even⠀if⠀no⠀outward⠀resolution⠀follows.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanbaal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀modern⠀experimental⠀inward-fiction⠀route.⠀Choose⠀one⠀familiar⠀distinction⠀that⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀collapses⠀for⠀the⠀focal⠀character:⠀inside⠀and⠀outside,⠀memory⠀and⠀present⠀observation,⠀work⠀and⠀sleep,⠀self⠀and⠀changed⠀body,⠀a⠀message⠀and⠀a⠀thought.⠀Begin⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀concrete⠀daily⠀moment⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀move⠀across⠀that⠀collapsed⠀boundary⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀passage⠀into⠀a⠀fixed⠀monologue.\n\nAnchor⠀each⠀interior⠀leap⠀in⠀an⠀exact⠀physical⠀fact.⠀Choose⠀a⠀brief⠀Kawabata-style⠀image—the⠀cold⠀rim⠀of⠀a⠀cup,⠀a⠀torn⠀sleeve⠀seam,⠀the⠀sudden⠀direction⠀of⠀wind⠀across⠀a⠀platform—and⠀let⠀it⠀trigger⠀a⠀longer⠀associative⠀chain.⠀The⠀chain⠀may⠀jump⠀between⠀memory⠀and⠀present⠀observation,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀physical⠀fact⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning.⠀For⠀example,⠀the⠀cold⠀rim⠀may⠀first⠀recall⠀a⠀morning⠀before⠀the⠀change,⠀then⠀become⠀the⠀sensation⠀of⠀a⠀hand⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀feels⠀temperature,⠀then⠀return⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀hand⠀holding⠀the⠀cup.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀connection;⠀let⠀the⠀return⠀carry⠀the⠀recognition.\n\nShape⠀causality⠀through⠀recurrence⠀and⠀contrast.⠀A⠀word,⠀color,⠀or⠀gesture⠀may⠀reappear⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀context⠀and⠀reveal⠀that⠀an⠀earlier⠀perception⠀meant⠀something⠀else.⠀When⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀affects⠀the⠀body,⠀show⠀the⠀body's⠀sensations⠀as⠀lived⠀changes,⠀not⠀as⠀clinical⠀data.⠀If⠀it⠀alters⠀perception,⠀make⠀the⠀character⠀misattribute⠀a⠀sound;⠀if⠀it⠀alters⠀work,⠀make⠀a⠀tool⠀or⠀process⠀produce⠀an⠀unexpected⠀interval;⠀if⠀it⠀alters⠀communication,⠀let⠀a⠀message⠀arrive⠀inside⠀the⠀thought⠀itself.\n\nLet⠀the⠀character⠀act⠀on⠀the⠀recognition,⠀or⠀fail⠀to,⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀beat.⠀Other⠀characters⠀may⠀interrupt,⠀misunderstand,⠀or⠀continue⠀their⠀own⠀inward⠀work;⠀their⠀outward⠀presence⠀should⠀remain⠀concrete.⠀The⠀experimental⠀form⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀consequence.⠀It⠀is⠀the⠀way⠀the⠀changed⠀world⠀becomes⠀available⠀to⠀this⠀particular⠀self,⠀with⠀all⠀the⠀confusion⠀and⠀partial⠀clarity⠀that⠀entails.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀recurring⠀physical⠀fact⠀has⠀completed⠀its⠀return⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀understanding⠀has⠀shifted,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀completed⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanbaam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀through⠀several⠀carefully⠀positioned⠀accounts.⠀The⠀route⠀combines⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀or⠀urban⠀fiction⠀with⠀polyphonic⠀or⠀nonlinear⠀telling,⠀but⠀the⠀structure⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀survey.⠀Choose⠀one⠀shared⠀physical⠀fact—an⠀apartment⠀window,⠀a⠀bus⠀stop⠀sign,⠀a⠀folded⠀paper⠀passed⠀between⠀hands,⠀the⠀smell⠀after⠀new⠀rain—and⠀let⠀each⠀account⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀at⠀a⠀different⠀temporal⠀moment.⠀Kawabata's⠀brief⠀sensory⠀image⠀becomes⠀the⠀common⠀object⠀that⠀no⠀two⠀observers⠀read⠀the⠀same⠀way.\n\nGive⠀each⠀account⠀a⠀distinct⠀causal⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀speculative⠀change.⠀One⠀perspective⠀may⠀know⠀the⠀change⠀through⠀work:⠀the⠀bus⠀stop⠀sign⠀now⠀marks⠀a⠀route⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀runs.⠀Another⠀may⠀know⠀it⠀through⠀a⠀body's⠀new⠀daily⠀limit:⠀the⠀folded⠀paper⠀is⠀a⠀medical⠀pass⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀shown⠀at⠀a⠀door.⠀Another⠀may⠀know⠀it⠀through⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀arrived⠀too⠀late:⠀the⠀apartment⠀window⠀is⠀where⠀a⠀signal⠀once⠀appeared.⠀Keep⠀those⠀paths⠀causally⠀distinct.⠀When⠀a⠀later⠀account⠀revises⠀an⠀earlier⠀one,⠀the⠀revision⠀must⠀come⠀from⠀that⠀character's⠀real⠀knowledge—a⠀worker⠀who⠀has⠀read⠀the⠀schedule,⠀a⠀patient⠀who⠀has⠀learned⠀the⠀pass's⠀terms,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀who⠀has⠀kept⠀the⠀old⠀signal's⠀timing—not⠀from⠀an⠀abstract⠀insight⠀injected⠀from⠀outside.\n\nUse⠀temporal⠀jumps⠀where⠀they⠀serve⠀recognition.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀open⠀after⠀the⠀change⠀has⠀already⠀become⠀ordinary,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀moment⠀before⠀it⠀was⠀fully⠀understood.⠀Let⠀that⠀return⠀be⠀sparse:⠀one⠀paragraph⠀of⠀sharply⠀observed⠀physical⠀movement⠀can⠀carry⠀more⠀than⠀a⠀summary.⠀The⠀shared⠀fact⠀should⠀accrue⠀weight⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀notices⠀how⠀each⠀observer's⠀temporal⠀position⠀changes⠀its⠀meaning,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀narrative⠀announces⠀a⠀theme.\n\nDo⠀not⠀import⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀unless⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀already⠀permits⠀them.⠀The⠀speculative⠀premise⠀itself⠀should⠀remain⠀concrete—whether⠀it⠀alters⠀communication,⠀labor,⠀memory,⠀or⠀climate—and⠀the⠀story's⠀intimacy⠀should⠀reveal⠀how⠀that⠀premise⠀has⠀already⠀entered⠀the⠀lives⠀of⠀the⠀people⠀telling⠀it.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀shared⠀fact⠀has⠀been⠀returned⠀to⠀by⠀each⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀how⠀the⠀observers'⠀different⠀knowledge⠀revises⠀the⠀whole,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀completed⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanbaan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀already⠀inside⠀the⠀speculative⠀situation,⠀but⠀make⠀the⠀changed⠀condition⠀visible⠀within⠀the⠀first⠀few⠀lines⠀through⠀a⠀practical⠀detail⠀rather⠀than⠀exposition.⠀Use⠀short⠀paragraphs:⠀one⠀for⠀action,⠀one⠀for⠀dialogue,⠀one⠀for⠀a⠀private⠀reaction⠀or⠀focused⠀perception.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀track;⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀moves⠀from⠀a⠀corridor⠀to⠀a⠀window⠀or⠀from⠀a⠀ship's⠀deck⠀to⠀a⠀lower⠀room,⠀give⠀one⠀concrete⠀transition⠀detail⠀and⠀continue.\n\nEstablish⠀one⠀concrete⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀that⠀creates⠀the⠀current⠀difficulty.⠀A⠀rule⠀about⠀water,⠀a⠀body's⠀visible⠀repair,⠀a⠀communication⠀lag,⠀or⠀a⠀work⠀shift⠀should⠀be⠀the⠀reason⠀the⠀next⠀choice⠀is⠀hard.⠀Explain⠀mechanics⠀only⠀when⠀a⠀decision⠀or⠀surprise⠀requires⠀them;⠀otherwise⠀let⠀them⠀remain⠀inside⠀action.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀brief⠀sensory⠀image⠀as⠀the⠀reaction⠀beat's⠀anchor.⠀Between⠀dialogue⠀lines,⠀write⠀a⠀single⠀sentence⠀that⠀holds⠀a⠀physical⠀impression—cool⠀metal⠀under⠀a⠀palm,⠀a⠀thread⠀pulled⠀from⠀a⠀sleeve,⠀the⠀pause⠀of⠀a⠀descending⠀lift—so⠀the⠀reader⠀feels⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀shift⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀action.⠀The⠀image⠀must⠀be⠀quick,⠀concrete,⠀and⠀linked⠀to⠀the⠀speculative⠀consequence:⠀the⠀cool⠀metal⠀is⠀the⠀ration⠀panel,⠀the⠀pulled⠀thread⠀is⠀the⠀repaired⠀sleeve,⠀the⠀descending⠀lift⠀is⠀the⠀delayed⠀signal.⠀Do⠀not⠀construct⠀elaborate⠀associative⠀prose.\n\nLet⠀the⠀reaction⠀beat⠀carry⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀attention⠀without⠀stopping⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀reaction⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀owner.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀tension⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause—often⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀character⠀recognizes⠀the⠀consequence⠀or⠀chooses⠀to⠀act⠀on⠀it—without⠀manufacturing⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀A⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀in⠀continuing⠀movement⠀or⠀thought.⠀The⠀light-novel⠀container⠀stays⠀readable⠀because⠀the⠀science-fictional⠀consequence⠀is⠀staged⠀through⠀clear⠀physical⠀beats,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀cast⠀is⠀young⠀or⠀the⠀tone⠀is⠀comic.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanbaao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀speculative⠀element⠀as⠀a⠀familiar⠀surface⠀made⠀strange⠀by⠀repeated,⠀closely⠀observed⠀contact.⠀Let⠀a⠀changed⠀routine—reading⠀a⠀maintenance⠀trace,⠀passing⠀a⠀sealed⠀garden,⠀waiting⠀through⠀a⠀solar⠀shift—become⠀the⠀occasion⠀for⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀physical⠀impressions⠀whose⠀relation⠀suggests⠀more⠀than⠀the⠀narrator⠀says.⠀Hold⠀one⠀image⠀long⠀enough⠀for⠀syntax⠀and⠀sound⠀to⠀carry⠀feeling:⠀a⠀white⠀diagnostic⠀light⠀that⠀ticks⠀as⠀it⠀cools,⠀a⠀stair⠀still⠀warm⠀from⠀an⠀empty⠀passing.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀mechanism⠀before⠀the⠀sensation⠀has⠀gathered⠀force;⠀if⠀explanation⠀matters,⠀let⠀it⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀character⠀already⠀lives⠀with,⠀such⠀as⠀the⠀third-day⠀smell⠀of⠀recycled⠀air⠀becoming⠀ordinary.\n\nBuild⠀each⠀paragraph⠀around⠀a⠀shift⠀of⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀complete⠀emotional⠀statement.⠀A⠀comparison⠀should⠀unfold⠀when⠀the⠀narrator⠀notices⠀how⠀one⠀thing⠀has⠀become⠀like⠀another:⠀the⠀hydroponic⠀scent⠀after⠀rain,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀shut⠀bulkhead⠀keeps⠀the⠀tone⠀of⠀an⠀unfinished⠀sentence.⠀Keep⠀comparisons⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀speculative⠀context⠀may⠀make⠀familiar⠀associations⠀strange—morning⠀is⠀a⠀scheduled⠀amber⠀band⠀across⠀the⠀ceiling,⠀and⠀the⠀word⠀for⠀'outside'⠀now⠀means⠀a⠀screen—but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀clause⠀a⠀conceit.⠀Plain⠀sentences⠀can⠀interpose:⠀\"The⠀door⠀was⠀locked.\"⠀\"She⠀did⠀not⠀turn⠀it⠀on.\"\n\nLet⠀recurrence⠀create⠀the⠀lyric⠀pattern.⠀A⠀small⠀gesture⠀or⠀object⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀altered⠀meaning⠀after⠀an⠀event,⠀like⠀a⠀glove⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀control⠀rail⠀before⠀a⠀departure.⠀Each⠀return⠀should⠀gather⠀rather⠀than⠀repeat⠀its⠀earlier⠀meaning.⠀The⠀ending⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀or⠀the⠀relationship;⠀it⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀narrator⠀inside⠀an⠀interval⠀of⠀ordinary⠀work⠀made⠀momentarily⠀visible⠀by⠀the⠀same⠀light,⠀sound,⠀or⠀absence⠀that⠀began⠀the⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanbaap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀make⠀one⠀ordinary⠀aspect⠀of⠀the⠀world⠀unavailable⠀or⠀changed,⠀and⠀write⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀to⠀that⠀change⠀through⠀remembered⠀occasions.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀recall⠀the⠀exact⠀pressure⠀of⠀a⠀manual⠀key⠀before⠀doors⠀began⠀reading⠀skin,⠀or⠀the⠀fuzz⠀of⠀an⠀unfiltered⠀radio⠀before⠀the⠀station⠀narrowed⠀to⠀one⠀channel.⠀The⠀present⠀technology⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀catastrophic;⠀the⠀reflection⠀gains⠀force⠀because⠀life⠀continues⠀in⠀a⠀slightly⠀reduced⠀or⠀altered⠀form.⠀Keep⠀the⠀loss⠀concrete⠀and⠀small:⠀the⠀absence⠀of⠀a⠀kitchen⠀smell⠀that⠀a⠀maintenance⠀change⠀removed,⠀a⠀sound⠀familiar⠀for⠀years⠀but⠀gone⠀after⠀the⠀last⠀update.\n\nUse⠀recollection⠀to⠀deepen⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀supply⠀backstory.⠀When⠀a⠀detail⠀triggers⠀memory,⠀let⠀the⠀memory⠀include⠀a⠀particular⠀sensory⠀fact⠀and⠀an⠀unfinished⠀attachment:⠀someone⠀who⠀taught⠀the⠀old⠀procedure,⠀a⠀room⠀visited⠀when⠀the⠀thing⠀still⠀worked.⠀Then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀with⠀the⠀remembered⠀fact⠀still⠀touching⠀it.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀reflect⠀directly⠀on⠀the⠀difference,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀every⠀paragraph⠀end⠀by⠀announcing⠀impermanence.⠀Plain,⠀continuing⠀life—a⠀functioning⠀schedule,⠀an⠀ordinary⠀meal—can⠀sit⠀beside⠀the⠀recognition⠀that⠀something⠀has⠀passed.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀reflection⠀to⠀settle⠀without⠀resolution.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀in⠀the⠀midst⠀of⠀a⠀continuing⠀task⠀or⠀conversation,⠀with⠀the⠀thought⠀of⠀the⠀changed⠀thing⠀still⠀present.⠀The⠀recollection⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀decision.⠀What⠀matters⠀is⠀the⠀coexistence⠀of⠀the⠀present⠀surface⠀and⠀the⠀remembered⠀one,⠀and⠀the⠀way⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀has⠀entered⠀the⠀flow⠀of⠀small⠀habitual⠀actions.⠀Mood⠀may⠀be⠀quiet,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀flatten⠀varied⠀characters⠀into⠀one⠀lamenting⠀tone;⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀remains⠀available.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanbaaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWork⠀in⠀the⠀lyric-philosophical,⠀social-realist⠀strand⠀of⠀the⠀tradition:⠀a⠀contemplative⠀account⠀of⠀home⠀life,⠀work,⠀or⠀neighborhood⠀changed⠀by⠀the⠀speculative⠀technology.⠀Use⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀setting,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀rather⠀than⠀importing⠀a⠀generic⠀courtyard,⠀bazaar,⠀or⠀religious⠀frame.⠀The⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀should⠀appear⠀through⠀domestic⠀or⠀urban⠀relations—how⠀water⠀is⠀now⠀delivered,⠀how⠀a⠀public⠀screen⠀reads⠀the⠀hour,⠀how⠀an⠀older⠀neighbor⠀uses⠀an⠀automated⠀mule⠀on⠀a⠀familiar⠀street.⠀Let⠀these⠀facts⠀arrive⠀within⠀someone's⠀daily⠀attention,⠀not⠀as⠀scenery⠀or⠀anthropology.\n\nAdopt⠀Kawabata's⠀compressed⠀sensory⠀images⠀inside⠀that⠀social⠀frame.⠀Select⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀hold⠀them⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀show⠀emotional⠀pressure:⠀a⠀worn⠀knob⠀no⠀one⠀touches⠀now⠀that⠀doors⠀respond⠀to⠀cards,⠀the⠀pause⠀in⠀a⠀sentence⠀when⠀a⠀delivery⠀drone⠀crosses⠀the⠀window.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀reflect⠀on⠀a⠀small⠀irreversible⠀change—a⠀daughter's⠀job⠀monitoring⠀the⠀city's⠀dust⠀sensors,⠀a⠀family⠀recipe⠀altered⠀because⠀one⠀ingredient⠀no⠀longer⠀grows.⠀The⠀reflection⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀elegy;⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀in⠀food,⠀company,⠀or⠀work⠀remains⠀available.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀account⠀a⠀composed,⠀flowing⠀narrative⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀telling⠀voice,⠀not⠀an⠀ornate⠀sequence⠀of⠀maxims.⠀If⠀direct⠀address⠀or⠀a⠀framing⠀voice⠀is⠀used,⠀it⠀should⠀be⠀the⠀narrator's⠀familiar⠀reflective⠀register⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀separate⠀story-teller⠀performance.⠀The⠀ending⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀change.⠀It⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀narrator⠀at⠀a⠀household⠀or⠀urban⠀interval—washing⠀a⠀cup,⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀cousin,⠀hearing⠀the⠀evening⠀broadcast—carrying⠀the⠀speculative⠀alteration⠀into⠀the⠀next⠀moment⠀without⠀a⠀conclusion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanbaar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀speculative⠀element⠀through⠀omission⠀and⠀precise⠀physical⠀detail.⠀Show⠀a⠀daily⠀act⠀affected⠀by⠀the⠀change⠀without⠀naming⠀its⠀history:⠀a⠀boy⠀slips⠀his⠀wrist⠀through⠀the⠀scanner⠀so⠀his⠀father⠀can⠀cook;⠀a⠀woman⠀sets⠀her⠀cup⠀on⠀the⠀table⠀where⠀the⠀translator⠀panel⠀used⠀to⠀sit.⠀One⠀or⠀two⠀details⠀establish⠀the⠀alteration.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀short⠀sentences:⠀\"The⠀water⠀took⠀longer⠀now.\"⠀\"She⠀covered⠀the⠀port⠀with⠀her⠀hand.\"⠀Let⠀the⠀relation⠀among⠀these⠀details⠀imply⠀the⠀consequence,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀strip⠀away⠀causality;⠀if⠀a⠀decision⠀depends⠀on⠀a⠀fact,⠀give⠀the⠀fact⠀briefly.⠀Technical⠀explanation⠀is⠀unnecessary⠀unless⠀it⠀changes⠀an⠀action⠀or⠀belief.\n\nKeep⠀inward⠀life⠀present⠀but⠀compressed.⠀A⠀thought⠀or⠀association⠀may⠀appear⠀if⠀it⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀current⠀moment,⠀and⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀single⠀sentence⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀paragraph.⠀The⠀narrator⠀might⠀think:⠀She⠀did⠀not⠀want⠀him⠀to⠀see⠀the⠀number.⠀That⠀thought⠀should⠀be⠀traceable⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀doing⠀and⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀philosophical⠀summary.⠀Characters⠀remain⠀distinct⠀through⠀their⠀small⠀choices⠀and⠀phrasing.⠀Do⠀not⠀reduce⠀everyone⠀to⠀terse⠀neutral⠀fragments.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀reply⠀at⠀the⠀immediate⠀surface.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀sentence,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup.⠀The⠀ending⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀a⠀realization,⠀a⠀changed⠀plan,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange.⠀It⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀speculative⠀fact⠀present⠀in⠀one⠀small⠀action:⠀a⠀hand⠀left⠀on⠀the⠀table⠀beside⠀the⠀unlit⠀reader,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀closes⠀a⠀second⠀late.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀infer⠀the⠀larger⠀world⠀from⠀that⠀exact⠀pause.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanbaas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀speculative⠀element⠀inside⠀a⠀continuous,⠀scene-first⠀narration.⠀Let⠀an⠀ordinary⠀activity—repairing⠀a⠀home⠀composter,⠀walking⠀a⠀child⠀to⠀a⠀transit⠀point,⠀clearing⠀a⠀plant⠀bed—show⠀how⠀the⠀changed⠀condition⠀affects⠀work,⠀communication,⠀or⠀living⠀space.⠀Keep⠀the⠀speculative⠀fact⠀concrete:⠀the⠀kitchen⠀screen⠀shows⠀the⠀neighborhood's⠀nitrogen⠀level;⠀the⠀bus⠀takes⠀a⠀different⠀route⠀because⠀the⠀edge⠀road⠀is⠀still⠀closed.⠀Do⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀a⠀set-piece⠀explanation.⠀If⠀a⠀technical⠀fact⠀matters⠀to⠀a⠀decision,⠀give⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀practical⠀terms⠀and⠀continue.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀sensory⠀images⠀inside⠀that⠀natural⠀movement.⠀A⠀paragraph⠀may⠀combine⠀an⠀action,⠀a⠀spoken⠀line,⠀a⠀remembered⠀touch,⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀without⠀announcing⠀the⠀transition.⠀Choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀precise⠀details⠀to⠀carry⠀feeling:⠀the⠀warm⠀edge⠀of⠀the⠀counter⠀after⠀the⠀generator⠀runs,⠀the⠀silence⠀when⠀the⠀speakers⠀quiet⠀at⠀dusk.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraphing⠀guide⠀attention⠀through⠀the⠀day,⠀rather⠀than⠀breaking⠀the⠀narrative⠀into⠀separated⠀perception,⠀reflection,⠀and⠀dialogue⠀blocks.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀should⠀be⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective⠀and⠀not⠀uniformly⠀the⠀author's⠀figurative⠀register.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀scene⠀open.⠀A⠀reply⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀an⠀action⠀unfinished,⠀a⠀conversation⠀in⠀progress,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀continuing.⠀There⠀is⠀no⠀required⠀lesson⠀or⠀reversal.⠀The⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀may⠀simply⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀ordinary⠀life,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀be⠀felt⠀in⠀the⠀movement⠀from⠀one⠀concrete⠀moment⠀to⠀the⠀next.⠀The⠀style⠀is⠀calm⠀and⠀continuous,⠀not⠀flattened;⠀varied⠀characters⠀keep⠀their⠀own⠀speech⠀and⠀concerns.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanbaat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nLet⠀the⠀relationship⠀carry⠀the⠀speculative⠀experience.⠀Choose⠀scenes⠀that⠀reveal⠀one⠀person⠀through⠀the⠀other's⠀attention,⠀using⠀the⠀premise⠀supplied⠀for⠀the⠀story:⠀who⠀taught⠀whom⠀to⠀read⠀the⠀ship's⠀old⠀log,⠀who⠀checks⠀the⠀other's⠀breathing⠀after⠀a⠀sealed-space⠀alert,⠀whose⠀hand⠀smooths⠀the⠀worn⠀seam⠀of⠀a⠀maintenance⠀jacket.⠀Keep⠀the⠀speculative⠀detail⠀intimate⠀rather⠀than⠀expository.⠀The⠀changed⠀world⠀appears⠀as⠀a⠀shared⠀practical⠀fact—a⠀red⠀warning⠀the⠀lovers⠀no⠀longer⠀mention,⠀a⠀schedule⠀they⠀keep⠀partly⠀from⠀habit—and⠀the⠀emotional⠀weight⠀comes⠀from⠀how⠀it⠀sits⠀between⠀them.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.\n\nBuild⠀private⠀language⠀from⠀Kawabata's⠀small⠀physical⠀impressions⠀and⠀omissions.⠀A⠀repeated⠀gesture⠀or⠀phrase⠀should⠀return⠀with⠀changed⠀meaning:⠀the⠀same⠀word⠀for⠀\"clear\"⠀said⠀before⠀a⠀corridor⠀scan,⠀then⠀later⠀to⠀mean⠀a⠀settled⠀quarrel.⠀Let⠀touch,⠀silence,⠀and⠀the⠀precise⠀object—a⠀cup⠀placed⠀between⠀two⠀chairs,⠀a⠀cooling⠀pad⠀shared⠀at⠀dawn—carry⠀longing,⠀jealousy,⠀or⠀comfort⠀without⠀stating⠀the⠀feeling⠀every⠀time.⠀Private⠀thoughts⠀remain⠀private⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character;⠀another's⠀motive⠀may⠀be⠀shown⠀through⠀action,⠀not⠀exposed⠀by⠀omniscient⠀commentary.⠀When⠀jealousy,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀premise,⠀give⠀it⠀space⠀in⠀actual⠀scenes,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀pause⠀conceal⠀a⠀confession.\n\nFulfill⠀the⠀emotional⠀promise⠀through⠀consequences,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀compulsory⠀resolution.⠀A⠀callback⠀may⠀reopen⠀an⠀attachment⠀or⠀confirm⠀a⠀reassurance,⠀and⠀the⠀reply⠀can⠀end⠀during⠀a⠀continuing⠀exchange⠀or⠀unfinished⠀moment.⠀The⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀bond⠀should⠀be⠀felt⠀in⠀the⠀cumulative⠀little⠀details⠀rather⠀than⠀announced⠀in⠀a⠀summary.⠀The⠀speculative⠀world⠀remains⠀the⠀ordinary⠀background⠀of⠀the⠀pair's⠀life:⠀a⠀shared⠀task,⠀a⠀waiting⠀interval,⠀a⠀private⠀joke⠀about⠀the⠀water⠀pressure.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanbaau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀speculative⠀story⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀about⠀these⠀people.⠀The⠀change—a⠀repaired⠀relay,⠀a⠀first⠀contact,⠀a⠀harbor's⠀new⠀barrier—should⠀enter⠀through⠀lived⠀consequence⠀and⠀be⠀fitted⠀into⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀deliberate⠀phrasing.⠀Use⠀a⠀formulaic⠀opening⠀or⠀compact⠀declaration⠀at⠀moments⠀of⠀retelling:⠀\"They⠀say⠀the⠀dust⠀farm⠀failed⠀in⠀the⠀year⠀of⠀the⠀wide⠀signal.\"⠀Then⠀give⠀the⠀particular⠀deed⠀with⠀Kawabata's⠀restraint:⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀worked⠀all⠀night,⠀the⠀child⠀who⠀learned⠀the⠀alert⠀siren's⠀two⠀notes.⠀Avoid⠀inflating⠀ordinary⠀labor⠀into⠀combat⠀or⠀doom;⠀the⠀line's⠀weight⠀comes⠀from⠀cumulative⠀community⠀memory,⠀not⠀magnificent⠀adjectives.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀to⠀organize⠀the⠀telling.⠀A⠀phrase⠀or⠀image⠀may⠀return⠀after⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀changes⠀its⠀meaning:⠀the⠀blue⠀light⠀of⠀the⠀first⠀repair⠀becomes⠀the⠀blue⠀light⠀of⠀the⠀last⠀transmission.⠀Let⠀the⠀recurring⠀element⠀be⠀a⠀small⠀physical⠀thing—a⠀key⠀that⠀opened⠀three⠀doors,⠀a⠀bowl⠀passed⠀down⠀the⠀table.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀distinguish⠀public⠀reputation⠀from⠀private⠀experience:⠀being⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀fixed⠀the⠀pump⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀knowing⠀why⠀she⠀no⠀longer⠀slept⠀near⠀the⠀window.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀answer⠀a⠀grand⠀introduction⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀concern,⠀and⠀dialogue⠀can⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority⠀without⠀becoming⠀parody.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀tradition⠀coherent.⠀If⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀oral-chronicle,⠀use⠀its⠀framing⠀and⠀broad⠀cadence⠀rather⠀than⠀importing⠀Nordic⠀pantheons,⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀oaths.⠀Ground⠀every⠀line⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀speculative⠀setting.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀an⠀act⠀still⠀open⠀to⠀remembrance—the⠀work⠀resumed,⠀the⠀message⠀half-received—not⠀by⠀pronouncing⠀the⠀community's⠀verdict.⠀The⠀story's⠀power⠀comes⠀from⠀precise⠀particular⠀actions⠀held⠀in⠀a⠀retelling⠀voice.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanbaav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀social-realist⠀route:⠀a⠀domestic⠀or⠀workplace⠀scene⠀anchored⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀institutional⠀or⠀communal⠀practice—a⠀housing⠀association,⠀a⠀shift⠀roster,⠀a⠀care⠀visit,⠀a⠀public⠀office,⠀a⠀shared⠀kitchen.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀enter⠀through⠀that⠀practice⠀as⠀a⠀concrete⠀alteration:⠀a⠀form⠀now⠀requires⠀a⠀new⠀answer,⠀a⠀delivery⠀arrives⠀on⠀a⠀different⠀schedule,⠀a⠀room⠀is⠀reassigned,⠀a⠀routine⠀inspection⠀asks⠀about⠀something⠀that⠀did⠀not⠀exist⠀before.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀perspective⠀close⠀to⠀one⠀character's⠀task⠀or⠀obligation.⠀Their⠀attention⠀selects⠀a⠀few⠀surfaces⠀and⠀pauses⠀over⠀what⠀is⠀difficult⠀to⠀hold:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀key,⠀the⠀spacing⠀of⠀names⠀on⠀a⠀list,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀closes⠀the⠀same⠀way.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀premise⠀in⠀full.⠀The⠀alteration⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀practice⠀it⠀disturbs,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀character⠀who⠀stops⠀to⠀describe⠀the⠀world.\n\nLet⠀the⠀emotional⠀weight⠀sit⠀in⠀the⠀interval⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀routine⠀promised⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀now⠀requires.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀continue⠀the⠀familiar⠀action⠀while⠀noticing⠀that⠀it⠀no⠀longer⠀fits,⠀or⠀may⠀hesitate⠀before⠀a⠀step⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀be⠀automatic.⠀Omission⠀is⠀visible⠀in⠀gesture,⠀delay,⠀or⠀a⠀briefly⠀noticed⠀object,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀stated⠀theme.\n\nInclude⠀only⠀the⠀dialogue⠀necessary⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀practical⠀exchange—a⠀request,⠀a⠀correction,⠀a⠀confirmation,⠀a⠀refusal.⠀What⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀say⠀matters⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀what⠀they⠀say,⠀but⠀leave⠀that⠀omission⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀physical⠀texture.⠀The⠀speculative⠀element⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀dramatic;⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀quiet⠀as⠀a⠀changed⠀food⠀package,⠀a⠀delayed⠀transport⠀announcement,⠀or⠀a⠀form⠀that⠀asks⠀an⠀unanswerable⠀question.\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀transient⠀moment—something⠀perceived,⠀half-completed,⠀or⠀just⠀beyond⠀the⠀characters'⠀control—without⠀requiring⠀a⠀resolution⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀comment.⠀The⠀future⠀remains⠀present⠀in⠀small,⠀ordinary⠀consequences⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀concluding⠀explanation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanbaaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀scene⠀headings⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes;⠀inside⠀a⠀continuous⠀scene,⠀use⠀concise⠀action⠀lines⠀to⠀show⠀the⠀speculative⠀element⠀as⠀an⠀ordinary⠀object,⠀movement,⠀or⠀sound.⠀Avoid⠀explanatory⠀dialogue.⠀A⠀character's⠀glance⠀at⠀a⠀monitor,⠀a⠀hesitation⠀before⠀opening⠀a⠀door,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀announcement⠀tone⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀world.\n\nUse⠀minimal⠀speaker⠀cues⠀and⠀short⠀lines.⠀Let⠀characters⠀speak⠀about⠀practical⠀matters—a⠀schedule,⠀a⠀delivery,⠀a⠀request—while⠀the⠀science-fictional⠀detail⠀remains⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀lines.⠀No⠀one⠀needs⠀to⠀explain⠀what⠀the⠀object⠀means.⠀If⠀a⠀nonspoken⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀required,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀note⠀outside⠀the⠀spoken⠀dialogue,⠀clearly⠀marked⠀as⠀not⠀heard⠀by⠀other⠀characters;⠀do⠀not⠀turn⠀it⠀into⠀voice-over⠀or⠀an⠀on-screen⠀caption.\n\nSelect⠀only⠀a⠀few⠀visual⠀details⠀per⠀scene:⠀one⠀texture,⠀one⠀light⠀change,⠀one⠀repeated⠀object.⠀Shift⠀attention⠀between⠀scenes⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs⠀it,⠀not⠀to⠀explain.⠀Offscreen⠀sound⠀may⠀indicate⠀the⠀world's⠀pressure—machinery,⠀wind,⠀a⠀distant⠀siren—and⠀should⠀be⠀noted⠀briefly.⠀A⠀pause⠀in⠀action⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀telling⠀as⠀movement.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀transient—a⠀door⠀closing,⠀a⠀light⠀changing,⠀a⠀hand⠀pausing—without⠀a⠀line⠀that⠀states⠀the⠀theme.⠀The⠀speculative⠀future⠀is⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀physical⠀details,⠀not⠀in⠀dialogue⠀or⠀narration.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanbaax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nUse⠀the⠀stage⠀space⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀speculative⠀condition⠀concrete⠀through⠀changed⠀habits⠀and⠀practical⠀business.⠀A⠀character⠀enters⠀with⠀an⠀object⠀that⠀now⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀routine—a⠀container,⠀a⠀pass,⠀a⠀package—and⠀handles⠀it⠀with⠀the⠀ease⠀or⠀hesitation⠀the⠀new⠀condition⠀has⠀produced.⠀Let⠀the⠀blocking⠀show⠀the⠀alteration:⠀someone⠀no⠀longer⠀touches⠀a⠀particular⠀surface,⠀waits⠀at⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀opens⠀on⠀its⠀own,⠀or⠀sets⠀down⠀an⠀item⠀in⠀a⠀place⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀be⠀empty.⠀Stage⠀directions⠀should⠀be⠀economical⠀but⠀precise⠀enough⠀for⠀actors⠀and⠀designers.\n\nWrite⠀dialogue⠀that⠀concerns⠀practical⠀matters—a⠀meal,⠀a⠀shift,⠀a⠀delivery—while⠀the⠀speculative⠀detail⠀sits⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀Characters⠀may⠀refer⠀to⠀it⠀indirectly⠀or⠀not⠀at⠀all.⠀Their⠀lines⠀should⠀be⠀short;⠀pauses⠀and⠀silences⠀can⠀carry⠀omission.⠀If⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀required,⠀keep⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀authoring⠀material⠀clearly⠀marked⠀as⠀not⠀spoken;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀stage⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue.⠀Only⠀use⠀an⠀aside⠀if⠀the⠀play's⠀dramatic⠀situation⠀authorizes⠀one,⠀and⠀it⠀must⠀reach⠀the⠀audience,⠀not⠀another⠀character.\n\nInclude⠀entrances⠀and⠀exits⠀that⠀reveal⠀relational⠀or⠀practical⠀consequences.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀leaves⠀before⠀a⠀question⠀is⠀answered,⠀or⠀another⠀who⠀enters⠀carrying⠀something⠀from⠀outside,⠀can⠀advance⠀the⠀world-state⠀without⠀exposition.⠀Use⠀props⠀as⠀recurring⠀sensory⠀anchors:⠀a⠀cup,⠀a⠀screen,⠀a⠀coat,⠀a⠀document⠀that⠀appears⠀or⠀disappears.\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀stage⠀action⠀or⠀pause⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀felt.⠀The⠀final⠀moment⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀character⠀alone⠀with⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀light⠀change,⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀that⠀acknowledges⠀the⠀situation⠀only⠀obliquely.⠀Do⠀not⠀close⠀with⠀a⠀thematic⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanbaay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀from⠀inside⠀one⠀authorized⠀character's⠀mind,⠀letting⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀speech,⠀and⠀bodily⠀sensation⠀flow⠀together.⠀Keep⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀present⠀not⠀as⠀exposition⠀but⠀as⠀a⠀recurring⠀anchor⠀the⠀mind⠀returns⠀to:⠀a⠀remembered⠀smell⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀exists,⠀a⠀familiar⠀surface⠀that⠀feels⠀wrong,⠀an⠀instruction⠀from⠀childhood⠀now⠀contradicted⠀by⠀a⠀changed⠀object⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀Let⠀that⠀anchor⠀organize⠀the⠀associative⠀movement—a⠀present⠀sensation⠀may⠀open⠀a⠀memory,⠀and⠀the⠀memory⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀altered⠀detail⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀inflection.\n\nUse⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀mind's⠀movement,⠀but⠀retain⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀from⠀memory⠀or⠀fantasy.⠀A⠀recollection⠀may⠀be⠀brief⠀and⠀sensory—a⠀card,⠀a⠀hand,⠀a⠀sound—without⠀a⠀full⠀explanation.⠀Let⠀a⠀recurring⠀concern⠀or⠀image⠀return⠀as⠀the⠀scene's⠀emotional⠀underside;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀resolved⠀or⠀even⠀fully⠀articulated.\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀world⠀enter⠀through⠀small,⠀practiced⠀details:⠀a⠀finger⠀on⠀a⠀scanner,⠀a⠀breath⠀of⠀filtered⠀air,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀glass.⠀The⠀character's⠀attention⠀may⠀slide⠀from⠀that⠀detail⠀to⠀an⠀unrelated⠀memory,⠀and⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀them⠀carries⠀the⠀loss⠀or⠀change.⠀Avoid⠀naming⠀the⠀feeling⠀directly;⠀show⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀selection⠀and⠀rhythm⠀of⠀impressions.\n\nThe⠀passage⠀may⠀end⠀mid-thought⠀or⠀at⠀a⠀brief⠀pause,⠀without⠀returning⠀to⠀external⠀action⠀or⠀concluding⠀the⠀inner⠀movement.⠀The⠀altered⠀future⠀remains⠀an⠀ongoing⠀condition⠀in⠀the⠀mind's⠀texture,⠀not⠀a⠀topic⠀to⠀be⠀summarized.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanbaaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nBuild⠀the⠀transcript⠀from⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Include⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀read⠀receipts,⠀unsent⠀drafts,⠀and⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀element⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀interface:⠀an⠀automatic⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀agency,⠀a⠀reply⠀delayed⠀by⠀a⠀system,⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀fails⠀to⠀send⠀because⠀of⠀an⠀altered⠀condition,⠀or⠀a⠀channel⠀that⠀now⠀demands⠀a⠀new⠀verification⠀step.\n\nWrite⠀messages⠀that⠀are⠀short⠀and⠀selective.⠀Characters⠀mention⠀practical⠀matters—a⠀schedule,⠀a⠀form,⠀a⠀location—while⠀leaving⠀the⠀larger⠀change⠀unstated.⠀Omissions⠀are⠀shown⠀by⠀a⠀long⠀gap,⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀ends⠀without⠀the⠀expected⠀follow-up,⠀or⠀a⠀briefly⠀indicated⠀unsent⠀draft⠀treated⠀as⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀If⠀interiority⠀is⠀required,⠀present⠀it⠀as⠀clearly⠀separated⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript,⠀labeled⠀as⠀non-transmitted;⠀do⠀not⠀turn⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀or⠀a⠀draft⠀that⠀reads⠀as⠀the⠀character⠀typing⠀their⠀thoughts.\n\nLet⠀each⠀character's⠀digital⠀habits⠀remain⠀distinct.⠀One⠀writes⠀in⠀fragments,⠀another⠀uses⠀full⠀sentences,⠀another⠀delays⠀replies.⠀The⠀style⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀universal⠀abbreviation;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀selective⠀surface⠀that⠀carries⠀relationship⠀and⠀situation.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀may⠀acquire⠀weight⠀when⠀it⠀appears⠀at⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀change.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀exchange⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause:⠀a⠀read⠀receipt⠀without⠀a⠀reply,⠀a⠀typing⠀indicator⠀that⠀stops,⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀message⠀that⠀acknowledges⠀the⠀practical⠀matter⠀only.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀conversation⠀to⠀resolve⠀the⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀thematic⠀closing⠀line.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanbaba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀concise⠀scene⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀labels⠀for⠀dialogue⠀and⠀short⠀focal⠀narration⠀for⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character.⠀Set⠀the⠀speculative⠀element⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀description:⠀a⠀subtly⠀altered⠀object,⠀a⠀new⠀piece⠀of⠀public⠀signage,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀quality⠀of⠀light,⠀or⠀a⠀routine⠀that⠀has⠀shifted.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀it;⠀let⠀the⠀background⠀cue⠀remain⠀a⠀visual⠀fact⠀that⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀briefly⠀notices.\n\nUse⠀dialogue⠀that⠀concerns⠀ordinary⠀matters—a⠀practical⠀request,⠀a⠀shared⠀task,⠀a⠀small⠀reassurance—while⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀stays⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀illustrated⠀environment.⠀Characters⠀may⠀refer⠀to⠀it⠀obliquely⠀or⠀not⠀at⠀all.⠀A⠀pause⠀or⠀a⠀selected⠀detail⠀can⠀carry⠀more⠀than⠀a⠀speech.⠀When⠀focal⠀inner⠀response⠀is⠀appropriate,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀short,⠀nonspoken⠀observation⠀or⠀sensation,⠀clearly⠀belonging⠀to⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀and⠀unknown⠀to⠀others;⠀do⠀not⠀convert⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀menu⠀or⠀player⠀choice.\n\nKeep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀scene⠀block.⠀A⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀is⠀a⠀purposeful⠀reference:⠀let⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀select⠀one⠀visual⠀fact—a⠀window,⠀a⠀cup,⠀a⠀figure⠀in⠀the⠀distance—and⠀notice⠀it⠀briefly.⠀That⠀same⠀image⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀significance⠀as⠀the⠀story⠀advances,⠀but⠀its⠀meaning⠀must⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀new⠀information,⠀not⠀by⠀repeating⠀the⠀cue⠀as⠀a⠀label.\n\nEnd⠀on⠀a⠀scene⠀or⠀focal⠀pause⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀situation⠀felt⠀and⠀open,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀decision⠀point,⠀relationship⠀flag,⠀or⠀cliffhanger.⠀The⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀remains⠀an⠀ambient⠀condition,⠀not⠀a⠀puzzle⠀to⠀solve.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanbabb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀each⠀installment⠀as⠀a⠀readable⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀practical⠀situation:⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀visit,⠀a⠀shift,⠀a⠀small⠀errand.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀element⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀concrete⠀local⠀detail—one⠀changed⠀object,⠀one⠀new⠀rule,⠀one⠀altered⠀routine—that⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀encounters⠀through⠀ordinary⠀activity.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀whole⠀world;⠀carry⠀only⠀the⠀detail⠀that⠀matters⠀now.\n\nAt⠀the⠀start⠀of⠀an⠀installment,⠀recover⠀context⠀briefly⠀if⠀needed,⠀by⠀recalling⠀a⠀specific⠀prior⠀detail⠀rather⠀than⠀summarizing.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀previously⠀noticed⠀a⠀lock⠀or⠀a⠀package,⠀have⠀them⠀pass⠀that⠀lock⠀or⠀mention⠀the⠀package⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀condition.⠀Let⠀the⠀repetition⠀deepen⠀understanding:⠀the⠀same⠀specific⠀object⠀can⠀now⠀suggest⠀a⠀different⠀consequence⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀happened⠀since.⠀This⠀recurring⠀detail⠀is⠀the⠀serial's⠀through-line,⠀not⠀a⠀restated⠀premise.\n\nKeep⠀prose⠀selective⠀and⠀emotionally⠀restrained.⠀Notice⠀only⠀a⠀few⠀sensory⠀impressions:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀bag,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀door,⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀screen.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀concern⠀practical⠀matters,⠀and⠀leave⠀larger⠀feelings⠀unstated.⠀Focal⠀interiority⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀brief,⠀well-chosen⠀observations⠀that⠀remain⠀private.⠀End⠀on⠀a⠀local⠀result⠀or⠀a⠀pause⠀that⠀continues⠀the⠀through-line—an⠀unanswered⠀request,⠀a⠀changed⠀schedule,⠀a⠀newly⠀understood⠀condition—without⠀forcing⠀a⠀dramatic⠀reversal⠀or⠀thematic⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
