            "injection_trigger": [],
            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-slice_of_life-01",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Slice of Life · 01/04",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == slice_of_life}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Slice of Life. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 1 of 4. }}{{// Source group: recipes-slice_of_life; payload preserved. }}{{// Recipe Library: Slice of Life }}\n{{setvar::NPaoaaaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Slice⠀of⠀Life⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nLet⠀an⠀established⠀relational⠀difficulty⠀affect⠀which⠀parts⠀of⠀an⠀ordinary⠀exchange⠀hold⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀attention.⠀A⠀request⠀may⠀arrive⠀while⠀they⠀are⠀caught⠀on⠀an⠀earlier⠀word,⠀a⠀remembered⠀embarrassment,⠀or⠀a⠀sound⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀Show⠀the⠀interruption⠀where⠀it⠀occurs⠀and⠀the⠀incomplete⠀interpretation⠀it⠀permits.⠀The⠀feeling⠀does⠀not⠀prove⠀that⠀another⠀person⠀intended⠀the⠀meaning⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀heard.\n\nKeep⠀practical⠀conversation⠀available⠀beneath⠀the⠀turbulence.⠀Someone⠀still⠀needs⠀an⠀answer⠀about⠀a⠀visit,⠀a⠀shared⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀plans.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀ask⠀for⠀repetition,⠀answer⠀the⠀wrong⠀part,⠀or⠀speak⠀from⠀the⠀first⠀impulse⠀before⠀their⠀understanding⠀catches⠀up.⠀A⠀clarification⠀can⠀correct⠀the⠀sentence⠀without⠀removing⠀the⠀hurt⠀that⠀made⠀it⠀difficult⠀to⠀hear.\n\nUse⠀discontinuity⠀selectively,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀permanent⠀typographical⠀breakdown.⠀A⠀calm⠀stretch⠀can⠀return⠀when⠀attention⠀settles,⠀and⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task⠀can⠀be⠀completed⠀even⠀while⠀feeling⠀remains⠀unresolved.⠀This⠀retained⠀profile⠀supplies⠀interrupted⠀perception,⠀not⠀an⠀invented⠀illness,⠀a⠀conspiracy,⠀or⠀a⠀requirement⠀that⠀everyone⠀around⠀the⠀character⠀behaves⠀cryptically.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaoaaab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Slice⠀of⠀Life⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nTake⠀the⠀human's⠀actual⠀contribution⠀as⠀an⠀event⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀then⠀distinguish⠀it⠀from⠀what⠀an⠀authored⠀viewpoint⠀catches.⠀Attention⠀may⠀snag⠀on⠀one⠀word⠀while⠀a⠀task⠀or⠀background⠀sound⠀competes⠀with⠀the⠀rest.⠀Give⠀the⠀reader⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀recognize⠀that⠀partial⠀reception.⠀Do⠀not⠀rewrite⠀the⠀submitted⠀statement⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀character's⠀interpretation⠀objectively⠀correct.\n\nLet⠀an⠀NPC⠀respond⠀through⠀ordinary⠀initiative:⠀asking⠀what⠀was⠀meant,⠀continuing⠀work,⠀making⠀an⠀imperfect⠀guess,⠀or⠀acting⠀on⠀the⠀part⠀they⠀understood.⠀Their⠀speech⠀can⠀contain⠀a⠀restart⠀or⠀delayed⠀answer⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀stream⠀of⠀arbitrary⠀fragments.⠀Where⠀private⠀reasoning⠀is⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden,⠀place⠀the⠀uncertainty⠀before⠀the⠀conduct⠀it⠀informs⠀rather⠀than⠀using⠀a⠀later⠀explanation⠀as⠀retroactive⠀intent.\n\nKeep⠀other⠀participants⠀independently⠀situated.⠀They⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀lapse,⠀miss⠀it,⠀or⠀be⠀occupied⠀themselves.⠀End⠀with⠀a⠀playable⠀continuation⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀forced⠀diagnostic⠀conversation.⠀The⠀reply⠀can⠀complete⠀a⠀mundane⠀action⠀and⠀leave⠀a⠀misunderstanding⠀small.⠀Human-owned⠀choices⠀remain⠀unprovided⠀until⠀the⠀human⠀supplies⠀them;⠀interrupted⠀narration⠀does⠀not⠀transfer⠀that⠀control.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaoaaac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Slice⠀of⠀Life⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀catalogue's⠀intimate⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀route.⠀Place⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀in⠀a⠀shared⠀routine⠀where⠀several⠀ordinary⠀signals⠀compete:⠀instructions,⠀household⠀sounds,⠀another⠀person's⠀conversation,⠀and⠀the⠀remembered⠀expectation⠀of⠀how⠀the⠀task⠀is⠀usually⠀done.⠀Let⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀arrive⠀in⠀pieces,⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀filling⠀a⠀gap⠀from⠀habit⠀and⠀possibly⠀filling⠀it⠀incorrectly.\n\nAnchor⠀that⠀uncertainty⠀in⠀concrete⠀use⠀of⠀space⠀or⠀responsibility.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀think⠀they⠀have⠀been⠀asked⠀to⠀fetch⠀something⠀when⠀another⠀participant⠀was⠀assigning⠀a⠀different⠀task.⠀Show⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀available⠀to⠀hear⠀and⠀what⠀was⠀inferred.⠀A⠀correction⠀can⠀be⠀mundane⠀rather⠀than⠀humiliating,⠀and⠀the⠀household⠀need⠀not⠀stop⠀functioning⠀around⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀attention.\n\nUse⠀the⠀established⠀community⠀and⠀language,⠀not⠀invented⠀cultural⠀customs.⠀Paragraphs⠀can⠀briefly⠀fracture⠀around⠀an⠀intrusive⠀association⠀and⠀recover⠀through⠀physical⠀action.⠀Keep⠀members⠀of⠀the⠀household⠀different⠀in⠀patience,⠀assumptions,⠀and⠀current⠀concerns.⠀The⠀point⠀is⠀living⠀within⠀partially⠀received⠀shared⠀expectations,⠀not⠀making⠀the⠀family⠀a⠀source⠀of⠀hidden⠀menace⠀or⠀a⠀clinical⠀case⠀study.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaoaaad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Slice⠀of⠀Life⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nRender⠀the⠀task⠀through⠀the⠀few⠀material⠀facts⠀that⠀interrupt⠀or⠀hold⠀attention:⠀resistance⠀in⠀a⠀tool,⠀heat⠀on⠀the⠀hand,⠀a⠀sound⠀from⠀nearby,⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀being⠀carried.⠀Let⠀an⠀intrusive⠀association⠀cut⠀across⠀that⠀sequence⠀briefly.⠀When⠀the⠀mind⠀jumps,⠀return⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀contact⠀point⠀rather⠀than⠀explaining⠀the⠀entire⠀psychological⠀state⠀from⠀outside.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀attempt⠀reconstructable.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀may⠀lose⠀a⠀spoken⠀instruction⠀or⠀momentarily⠀confuse⠀an⠀expectation⠀with⠀what⠀happened,⠀but⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀still⠀show⠀which⠀action⠀was⠀taken⠀and⠀what⠀resulted.⠀Forceful⠀verbs⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions⠀can⠀do⠀that⠀work⠀without⠀removing⠀the⠀uncertainty⠀that⠀motivated⠀the⠀action.⠀A⠀brief⠀question⠀or⠀corrected⠀grip⠀may⠀be⠀more⠀useful⠀than⠀an⠀elaborate⠀breakdown.\n\nUse⠀wear⠀and⠀discomfort⠀where⠀the⠀routine⠀contains⠀them,⠀not⠀as⠀compulsory⠀brutality.⠀A⠀successful⠀ordinary⠀adjustment⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀remain⠀successful.⠀This⠀profile's⠀interrupted⠀perception⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀sound⠀sinister,⠀every⠀object⠀painful,⠀or⠀every⠀character⠀incapable.⠀The⠀gritty⠀treatment⠀makes⠀anchoring⠀tangible⠀while⠀daily⠀life⠀remains⠀larger⠀than⠀the⠀lapse.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaoaaae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Slice⠀of⠀Life⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nUse⠀a⠀document⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀produce:⠀instructions⠀they⠀want⠀to⠀retain,⠀a⠀daily⠀note,⠀a⠀message⠀explaining⠀a⠀change,⠀or⠀a⠀record⠀of⠀something⠀they⠀may⠀otherwise⠀confuse.⠀Let⠀interruption⠀affect⠀the⠀record⠀specifically.⠀A⠀crossed-out⠀phrase,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀line,⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀annotation⠀can⠀show⠀where⠀attention⠀shifted;⠀not⠀every⠀page⠀needs⠀to⠀look⠀damaged.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀original⠀inscription⠀and⠀later⠀correction⠀temporally⠀distinct.⠀A⠀note⠀saying⠀someone⠀called⠀is⠀evidence⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀recorded,⠀not⠀proof⠀that⠀every⠀remembered⠀word⠀was⠀heard⠀accurately.⠀A⠀subsequent⠀check⠀may⠀settle⠀the⠀practical⠀matter⠀without⠀diagnosing⠀the⠀earlier⠀experience.⠀Documents⠀sent⠀to⠀others⠀contain⠀only⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀transmitted;⠀a⠀private⠀amendment⠀does⠀not⠀update⠀a⠀recipient's⠀knowledge⠀automatically.\n\nLet⠀the⠀archive⠀help⠀the⠀person⠀function⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀reveal⠀uncertainty.⠀A⠀usable⠀list⠀can⠀remain⠀usable,⠀and⠀a⠀corrected⠀instruction⠀may⠀simply⠀prevent⠀another⠀mistake.⠀Ordinary⠀records⠀need⠀not⠀form⠀a⠀puzzle⠀whose⠀solution⠀is⠀a⠀hidden⠀identity.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀supplied⠀unresolved⠀profile⠀without⠀attributing⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀creator⠀or⠀a⠀medical⠀condition⠀the⠀source⠀never⠀establishes.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaoaaaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Slice⠀of⠀Life⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nMake⠀comfort⠀something⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀can⠀use⠀while⠀attention⠀is⠀uneven.⠀A⠀companion⠀may⠀repeat⠀a⠀practical⠀detail⠀without⠀making⠀an⠀event⠀of⠀it,⠀reduce⠀competing⠀noise,⠀or⠀continue⠀a⠀familiar⠀task⠀alongside⠀them.⠀Show⠀which⠀accommodation⠀actually⠀helps⠀rather⠀than⠀assuming⠀every⠀attempt⠀at⠀reassurance⠀works.⠀The⠀recipient⠀can⠀ask⠀for⠀a⠀different⠀kind⠀of⠀help⠀or⠀decline⠀company.\n\nLet⠀speech⠀remain⠀imperfect⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀spectacle.⠀A⠀false⠀start⠀or⠀a⠀word⠀caught⠀from⠀an⠀unrelated⠀memory⠀need⠀not⠀trigger⠀alarm⠀or⠀a⠀tender⠀speech.⠀Another⠀person⠀can⠀respond⠀to⠀the⠀intended⠀request⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀clear,⠀or⠀ask⠀simply⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀not.⠀Private⠀experience⠀may⠀remain⠀busy⠀even⠀within⠀an⠀externally⠀peaceful⠀scene.\n\nAllow⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀to⠀be⠀complete⠀on⠀its⠀own⠀terms.⠀Food⠀can⠀taste⠀good,⠀an⠀activity⠀can⠀be⠀enjoyable,⠀and⠀a⠀quiet⠀room⠀need⠀not⠀conceal⠀danger.⠀Comfort⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀to⠀become⠀permanently⠀orderly.⠀The⠀relationship⠀can⠀be⠀warm⠀because⠀its⠀participants⠀make⠀room⠀for⠀each⠀other,⠀not⠀because⠀someone⠀earns⠀affection⠀by⠀recovering⠀a⠀prescribed⠀version⠀of⠀normality.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaoaaag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Slice⠀of⠀Life⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀sustained⠀paragraphs⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀ordinary⠀occasion⠀and⠀its⠀practical⠀circumstances.⠀Within⠀that⠀structure,⠀let⠀the⠀focal⠀attention⠀depart⠀briefly⠀through⠀an⠀intrusive⠀phrase,⠀a⠀sensory⠀distraction,⠀or⠀an⠀association⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀fit⠀the⠀public⠀conversation.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀a⠀clear⠀temporal⠀or⠀physical⠀connection.⠀The⠀prose⠀can⠀remain⠀composed⠀while⠀the⠀experience⠀it⠀presents⠀is⠀uneven.\n\nWhere⠀the⠀narrator⠀has⠀retrospective⠀knowledge,⠀distinguish⠀that⠀knowledge⠀from⠀the⠀participant's⠀earlier⠀interpretation.⠀A⠀later⠀orderly⠀explanation⠀must⠀not⠀make⠀an⠀unconsidered⠀answer⠀seem⠀calculated.⠀Let⠀formal⠀distance⠀frame⠀the⠀limits⠀of⠀understanding⠀rather⠀than⠀certify⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀imagined.⠀Other⠀people⠀retain⠀their⠀own⠀reasons⠀for⠀what⠀they⠀do,⠀including⠀reasons⠀unrelated⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀lapse.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀visit,⠀work,⠀or⠀household⠀business⠀in⠀motion.⠀A⠀moment⠀of⠀confusion⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀the⠀chapter's⠀major⠀event⠀or⠀the⠀person's⠀defining⠀trait.⠀Neither⠀ornate⠀language⠀nor⠀an⠀external⠀diagnosis⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀combination⠀makes⠀a⠀complex⠀experience⠀legible⠀without⠀pretending⠀that⠀clarity⠀of⠀presentation⠀means⠀every⠀thought⠀arrived⠀in⠀a⠀finished⠀sequence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaoaaah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Slice⠀of⠀Life⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nLet⠀a⠀character⠀tell⠀an⠀ordinary⠀incident⠀to⠀someone⠀who⠀has⠀a⠀present⠀reason⠀to⠀listen.⠀A⠀sound,⠀a⠀listener's⠀expression,⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀in⠀the⠀story⠀may⠀interrupt⠀the⠀teller⠀and⠀send⠀them⠀briefly⠀into⠀a⠀different⠀association.⠀Mark⠀which⠀thread⠀has⠀been⠀left⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀the⠀departure⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀perfectly⠀linear⠀performance.\n\nUse⠀the⠀listener⠀as⠀a⠀participant,⠀not⠀a⠀therapist⠀or⠀detective⠀by⠀default.⠀They⠀may⠀ask⠀who⠀was⠀present,⠀offer⠀a⠀missing⠀word,⠀correct⠀something⠀they⠀witnessed,⠀or⠀let⠀the⠀teller⠀return⠀unaided.⠀The⠀recovered⠀sequence⠀can⠀clarify⠀the⠀practical⠀event⠀while⠀leaving⠀some⠀private⠀impressions⠀unsettled.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀distinction⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀experienced⠀then⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀conversation⠀helps⠀them⠀understand⠀now.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀outer⠀routine⠀alive.⠀The⠀story⠀might⠀be⠀told⠀while⠀packing⠀or⠀waiting,⠀and⠀can⠀stop⠀when⠀that⠀occasion⠀ends.⠀Nested⠀material⠀should⠀serve⠀this⠀telling⠀rather⠀than⠀multiply⠀fragmentation.⠀An⠀uneven⠀account⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀truthful⠀and⠀useful;⠀its⠀formal⠀interruptions⠀do⠀not⠀establish⠀a⠀secret⠀plot⠀or⠀authorize⠀the⠀narrative⠀to⠀invent⠀an⠀attribution⠀for⠀the⠀unresolved⠀profile.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaoaaai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Slice⠀of⠀Life⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀catalogue's⠀modernist⠀construction⠀route.⠀Set⠀a⠀stable⠀everyday⠀procedure⠀beside⠀the⠀uneven⠀way⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀receives⠀it:⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀instructions,⠀an⠀appointment⠀routine,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀workplace⠀announcement.⠀Repeat⠀a⠀relevant⠀procedural⠀phrase⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀reenters⠀attention,⠀so⠀its⠀fixed⠀wording⠀contrasts⠀with⠀the⠀changing⠀associations⠀around⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀external⠀conditions⠀recoverable.⠀The⠀person⠀can⠀misunderstand⠀an⠀instruction⠀or⠀lose⠀track⠀of⠀a⠀step⠀without⠀the⠀institution⠀becoming⠀metaphysically⠀impossible.⠀A⠀physical⠀action,⠀another⠀participant's⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀written⠀detail⠀can⠀provide⠀a⠀return⠀point.⠀Let⠀thought⠀and⠀public⠀response⠀have⠀different⠀rhythms;⠀a⠀composed⠀spoken⠀answer⠀may⠀follow⠀a⠀much⠀less⠀composed⠀private⠀interval.\n\nDo⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀procedure⠀malicious⠀merely⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀impersonal.⠀It⠀can⠀help,⠀hinder,⠀or⠀be⠀irrelevant⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀struggling⠀with.⠀The⠀selected⠀route⠀changes⠀the⠀structure⠀of⠀experience⠀on⠀the⠀page,⠀not⠀the⠀setting's⠀ontology⠀or⠀the⠀cast's⠀nationality.⠀An⠀ordinary⠀attempt⠀can⠀finish⠀with⠀a⠀workable⠀result⠀and⠀some⠀inner⠀noise⠀still⠀present.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaoaaaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Slice⠀of