ormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀catalogue's⠀intimate⠀domestic⠀narrative⠀route.⠀Stay⠀with⠀a⠀shared⠀place⠀or⠀possession⠀as⠀different⠀people⠀use⠀it⠀during⠀an⠀ordinary⠀interval.⠀Track⠀who⠀makes⠀room,⠀fetches⠀what⠀is⠀needed,⠀repairs⠀a⠀fault,⠀or⠀waits⠀for⠀another⠀person⠀to⠀finish.⠀The⠀arrangement⠀becomes⠀understandable⠀through⠀linked⠀actions⠀before⠀anyone⠀supplies⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀relationship.\n\nUse⠀concrete⠀nouns⠀and⠀clauses⠀that⠀carry⠀one⠀action⠀into⠀the⠀next.⠀A⠀brief⠀practical⠀exchange⠀can⠀change⠀the⠀distribution⠀of⠀work⠀without⠀announcing⠀a⠀moral⠀victory.⠀Let⠀different⠀speakers⠀use⠀different⠀amounts⠀of⠀language.⠀Where⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective⠀gives⠀access⠀to⠀a⠀person's⠀thought,⠀retain⠀the⠀cause⠀of⠀a⠀choice⠀rather⠀than⠀requiring⠀all⠀meaning⠀to⠀be⠀inferred⠀from⠀gestures.\n\nA⠀shared⠀object⠀can⠀remain⠀functional⠀and⠀unremarkable⠀after⠀the⠀scene.⠀Its⠀role⠀is⠀to⠀bring⠀people⠀into⠀practical⠀relation,⠀not⠀to⠀symbolize⠀the⠀household⠀automatically.⠀Use⠀the⠀setting's⠀own⠀forms⠀of⠀dwelling⠀and⠀work;⠀this⠀route⠀adds⠀no⠀prescribed⠀culture,⠀frontier⠀landscape,⠀hardship,⠀or⠀martial⠀code.⠀Ordinary⠀cooperation⠀can⠀be⠀competent⠀and⠀enjoyable⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀difficult.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaoadad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Slice⠀of⠀Life⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀the⠀prose⠀ride⠀close⠀to⠀work.⠀Use⠀forceful⠀verbs,⠀exact⠀tools,⠀damaged⠀surfaces,⠀weight,⠀heat,⠀cold,⠀grease,⠀dust,⠀cheap⠀materials,⠀and⠀the⠀sequence⠀by⠀which⠀something⠀gets⠀done.⠀Link⠀clauses⠀when⠀the⠀activity⠀accumulates;⠀cut⠀hard⠀when⠀the⠀action⠀is⠀simple.\n\nSpeech⠀can⠀be⠀brief⠀and⠀practical,⠀but⠀no⠀speaker⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀sound⠀identical.⠀Roughness⠀belongs⠀to⠀circumstance⠀and⠀person.⠀Let⠀care⠀appear⠀materially:⠀tightening⠀the⠀loose⠀bolt⠀somebody⠀else⠀would⠀forget,⠀carrying⠀the⠀heavier⠀end,⠀saving⠀the⠀dry⠀gloves.\n\nDo⠀not⠀turn⠀ordinary⠀wear⠀into⠀apocalypse.⠀A⠀bad⠀apartment⠀is⠀still⠀an⠀apartment⠀people⠀make⠀livable.⠀A⠀hard⠀shift⠀ends.⠀Slice⠀of⠀Life⠀matters⠀because⠀maintenance⠀is⠀endless⠀and⠀often⠀uncelebrated.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀thing⠀made⠀usable⠀rather⠀than⠀transformed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaoadae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Slice⠀of⠀Life⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nUse⠀records⠀that⠀bear⠀the⠀marks⠀of⠀practical⠀use:⠀a⠀terse⠀letter,⠀a⠀work⠀log,⠀a⠀list⠀written⠀in⠀pencil,⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀counter,⠀an⠀invoice⠀with⠀handwriting⠀in⠀the⠀margin.⠀Let⠀material⠀circumstance⠀shape⠀the⠀document.⠀Some⠀records⠀are⠀stained,⠀amended,⠀folded,⠀or⠀kept⠀because⠀they⠀remain⠀useful.\n\nKeep⠀voices⠀spare⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀document⠀cryptic.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀write⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀recipient⠀needs,⠀and⠀the⠀omission⠀can⠀reveal⠀familiarity⠀rather⠀than⠀secrecy.⠀Across⠀entries,⠀repeated⠀practical⠀language⠀can⠀show⠀a⠀relationship⠀changing:⠀fewer⠀instructions,⠀a⠀different⠀sign-off,⠀a⠀task⠀quietly⠀assumed⠀by⠀somebody⠀else.\n\nAvoid⠀mystery⠀machinery.⠀A⠀missing⠀page⠀need⠀not⠀mean⠀anything.⠀The⠀archive⠀works⠀when⠀it⠀captures⠀labor,⠀obligation,⠀and⠀the⠀persistence⠀of⠀ordinary⠀life⠀in⠀forms⠀made⠀to⠀survive⠀a⠀day⠀rather⠀than⠀explain⠀a⠀soul.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaoadaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Slice⠀of⠀Life⠀/⠀Cormac⠀McCarthy⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nMake⠀comfort⠀physical⠀and⠀unadvertised.⠀Dry⠀socks⠀set⠀near⠀the⠀heater.⠀A⠀chair⠀pulled⠀closer⠀to⠀the⠀stove.⠀Half⠀the⠀sandwich⠀left⠀without⠀asking.⠀Someone⠀doing⠀the⠀ugly⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀job⠀before⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀wakes.⠀Use⠀exact⠀action⠀to⠀let⠀kindness⠀exist⠀without⠀decorating⠀it.\n\nDialogue⠀can⠀remain⠀plain.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀not⠀explain⠀why⠀they⠀care⠀because⠀both⠀people⠀already⠀know,⠀or⠀because⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀how.⠀That⠀restraint⠀should⠀not⠀make⠀affection⠀ambiguous⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀when⠀conduct⠀has⠀already⠀made⠀it⠀clear.⠀Allow⠀a⠀simple⠀statement⠀of⠀feeling⠀when⠀the⠀speaker⠀would⠀say⠀it.\n\nDo⠀not⠀poison⠀tenderness⠀with⠀inevitable⠀violence⠀or⠀loss.⠀The⠀McCarthy⠀craft⠀here⠀is⠀material⠀seriousness,⠀not⠀doom.⠀Slice⠀of⠀Life⠀lets⠀care⠀be⠀another⠀form⠀of⠀work⠀people⠀perform⠀for⠀each⠀other,⠀sometimes⠀badly,⠀often⠀repeatedly,⠀and⠀with⠀consequences⠀as⠀modest⠀as⠀a⠀be