aoapaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Slice⠀of⠀Life⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nLet⠀the⠀transcript⠀carry⠀a⠀real⠀practical⠀exchange:⠀assigning⠀a⠀task,⠀arranging⠀a⠀visit,⠀requesting⠀help,⠀or⠀clarifying⠀a⠀routine.⠀Notice⠀differences⠀in⠀what⠀participants⠀are⠀expected⠀to⠀supply.⠀One⠀person's⠀short⠀answer⠀may⠀be⠀accepted⠀while⠀another⠀receives⠀follow-up⠀demands;⠀a⠀message⠀called⠀optional⠀may⠀be⠀treated⠀as⠀compulsory⠀in⠀later⠀replies.⠀Establish⠀this⠀through⠀actual⠀messages⠀rather⠀than⠀narratorial⠀certainty⠀about⠀hidden⠀motives.\n\nKeep⠀interface⠀evidence⠀bounded.⠀A⠀delay⠀is⠀not⠀proof⠀of⠀disrespect,⠀and⠀a⠀read⠀receipt⠀cannot⠀show⠀whether⠀somebody⠀had⠀time⠀to⠀respond.⠀Private⠀drafts⠀and⠀thoughts⠀may⠀reveal⠀the⠀burden⠀of⠀composing⠀an⠀answer,⠀but⠀they⠀remain⠀separate⠀from⠀sent⠀text⠀and⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀know.⠀Allow⠀literal⠀misunderstanding⠀and⠀genuinely⠀useful⠀clarification.\n\nThe⠀exchange⠀may⠀improve⠀through⠀one⠀explicit⠀limit⠀or⠀a⠀redistributed⠀task.⠀It⠀may⠀also⠀end⠀ordinarily⠀without⠀anyone⠀naming⠀the⠀pattern.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀devastating⠀final⠀message⠀or⠀group-chat⠀pile-on.⠀The⠀social⠀observation⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀distribution⠀of⠀everyday⠀attention⠀and⠀work,⠀not⠀from⠀making⠀digital⠀silence⠀a⠀universal⠀sign⠀of⠀hostility.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
