            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-slice_of_life-03",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Slice of Life · 03/04",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == slice_of_life}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Slice of Life. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 3 of 4. }}{{// Source group: recipes-slice_of_life; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPaoapba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Slice⠀of⠀Life⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nEstablish⠀the⠀ordinary⠀use⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀room⠀or⠀recurring⠀encounter⠀through⠀clear⠀scene⠀description,⠀attributed⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀a⠀few⠀practical⠀actions.⠀On⠀a⠀return,⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀notice⠀who⠀performs⠀the⠀same⠀task,⠀receives⠀the⠀same⠀interruption,⠀or⠀must⠀justify⠀the⠀same⠀request.⠀The⠀repeated⠀setting⠀supplies⠀a⠀comparison,⠀not⠀an⠀automatic⠀cue⠀that⠀something⠀sinister⠀is⠀hidden⠀there.\n\nGive⠀focal⠀narration⠀a⠀specific⠀interpretation⠀and⠀the⠀possibility⠀of⠀revision.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀an⠀inequity,⠀misread⠀an⠀innocent⠀difference,⠀or⠀recognize⠀their⠀own⠀earlier⠀blindness.⠀Expression⠀cues⠀support⠀readability⠀without⠀functioning⠀as⠀truth⠀flags.⠀Required⠀interiority⠀retains⠀its⠀selected⠀presentation⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀information⠀the⠀entire⠀cast⠀shares.\n\nA⠀later⠀scene⠀can⠀alter⠀the⠀pattern⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀practical⠀correction.⠀Once⠀it⠀changes,⠀preserve⠀the⠀change⠀rather⠀than⠀replaying⠀the⠀same⠀slight⠀to⠀generate⠀drama.⠀The⠀visual-novel⠀treatment⠀makes⠀ordinary⠀repetition⠀inspectable⠀without⠀adding⠀route⠀scores,⠀moral⠀choice⠀menus,⠀or⠀a⠀predetermined⠀arc⠀in⠀which⠀every⠀relationship⠀must⠀be⠀exposed⠀as⠀harmful.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaoapbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Slice⠀of⠀Life⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nCarry⠀an⠀ordinary⠀expectation⠀across⠀installments⠀through⠀what⠀people⠀actually⠀do.⠀A⠀task⠀once⠀redistributed⠀should⠀stay⠀redistributed⠀until⠀something⠀causes⠀another⠀change;⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀learns⠀a⠀limit⠀need⠀not⠀forget⠀it⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀episode.⠀Reorient⠀through⠀the⠀present⠀use⠀of⠀the⠀arrangement⠀rather⠀than⠀repeatedly⠀explaining⠀its⠀original⠀unfairness.\n\nLet⠀l