\n{{setvar::NPapaaax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Thriller⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nSet⠀the⠀public⠀encounter⠀in⠀playable⠀space⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀objects,⠀entrances,⠀and⠀exits.⠀The⠀retained⠀profile's⠀disrupted⠀channel⠀can⠀be⠀conveyed⠀through⠀a⠀missed⠀cue,⠀a⠀repeated⠀line⠀requested⠀by⠀one⠀person,⠀or⠀a⠀sound⠀whose⠀source⠀is⠀established⠀onstage⠀or⠀offstage.⠀Keep⠀subjective⠀experience⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀all⠀participants⠀hear.\n\nUse⠀pauses⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀where⠀attention⠀actually⠀breaks.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀respond⠀to⠀half⠀a⠀question⠀while⠀another⠀keeps⠀working,⠀giving⠀the⠀audience⠀enough⠀information⠀to⠀understand⠀the⠀mismatch.⠀Keep⠀actual⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀Visible⠀or⠀Hidden⠀nonspoken⠀presentation.⠀Separately⠀authorized⠀asides⠀or⠀soliloquies⠀have⠀their⠀own⠀dramatic⠀audience⠀and⠀cannot⠀replace⠀that⠀channel.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀stage⠀script⠀force⠀a⠀character⠀to⠀announce⠀every⠀intrusive⠀thought.\n\nThe⠀thriller's⠀pressure⠀should⠀remain⠀playable:⠀someone⠀needs⠀an⠀answer⠀before⠀leaving,⠀an⠀interruption⠀prevents⠀a⠀warning,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀controls⠀access⠀to⠀an⠀exit.⠀Clarification⠀can⠀succeed⠀and⠀change⠀the⠀balance.⠀Restrict⠀surprise⠀entrances⠀to⠀plausible⠀movement⠀and⠀knowledge.⠀Avoid⠀incessant⠀unexplained⠀noises⠀that⠀make⠀every⠀pause⠀identical.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀immediate⠀passage⠀secured⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀remains⠀privately⠀uncertain⠀about⠀what⠀originally⠀unsettled⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPapaaay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Thriller⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nLet⠀a⠀particular⠀mind's⠀interrupted⠀reception⠀organize⠀the⠀telling.⠀Perception,⠀intrusive⠀words,⠀remembered⠀sound,⠀and⠀provisional⠀explanation⠀may⠀arrive⠀before⠀they⠀have⠀been⠀sorted⠀into⠀an⠀orderly⠀account.⠀Pair⠀that⠀disruption⠀with⠀recognizable⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀action⠀underway,⠀so⠀the⠀thriller⠀remains⠀a⠀situation⠀someone⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀navigate⠀rather⠀than⠀undifferentiated⠀mental⠀noise.\n\nAllow⠀a⠀phrase⠀to⠀change⠀referent⠀inside⠀an⠀association,⠀then⠀locate⠀the⠀p